1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Östedt , Fredrik Reinhold'''
2 CONT * * 1766-01-02
2 CONT * † after 1797
2 CONT
2 CONT '''F.R.Ö. was educated at the Imperial Mountain Cadet Corps''' in Saint Petersburg, Russia. Backman (1995, 264) notes that he upheld the rank of lieutenant and an enclosed comment is stating Fredrik as having ''"reached the height
2 CONC  of all here living languages and all sorts of sciences"'', though not verifiable as a graduate in the archives of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Petersburg_Mining_Institute Saint Petersburg Mining Institute], there are gaps 
2 CONC in the records for 1794. Fredrik was still living in 1797.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT * Backman, Christina. “Lenins svenska anor.” ''Släkt och Hävd'' №1 (1995): 253–273, p. 264.
