1 NAME Carl Persson /Borg/
2 GIVN Carl Persson
2 _MARNM Borg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1702 AND 1705
2 ADDR
3 STAE Kalmar
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 JUN 1750
2 ADDR
3 CITY Degerby (Lovisa)
3 CTRY Finland
1 OCCU Master hatter, hattmakare
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Borg, Carl Persson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Borg som var verksam som hattmakare och borgare i Uppsala en tid innan han efter utdragna rättsprocesser flyttade till Finland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * * Probably between 1702-1705, in Vimmerby, Sweden. The baptismal is missing.
2 CONT * oo 1735-07-13
2 CONT * † 1750-06-20
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Was a hatter by profession. Journeyman / apprentice in Uppsala 1735. Bourgeois 1736-10-04'''. After many years of judicial dealings he left the bourgeois, and then Uppsala in 1748. Died 1750-06-20 in Degerby (i.e. ''[http://en.
2 CONC wikipedia.org/wiki/Loviisa Loviisa]'' from 1752), Finland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
