1 NAME Carl Magnus /Borg/
2 GIVN Carl Magnus
2 _MARNM Borg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 MAY 1739
2 ADDR
3 CITY Uppsala
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BAPM
2 DATE 24 MAY 1739
2 ADDR
3 CITY Uppsala domkyrkoförsamling
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1805
2 ADDR
3 CITY Moscow
3 CTRY Russia
1 OCCU Master hatter, hattmakare
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Borg, Carl Magnus'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1739-05-23
2 CONT * ~ 1739-05-24
2 CONT * ooI 1764-10-07
2 CONT * Io|o 1770-10-25
2 CONT * ooII 1773-07-25
2 CONT * IIo|o 1777-06-07
2 CONT * ooIII 1782-05-05
2 CONT * † end of 1805
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Master hatter 1765. Bourgeois 1765-05-25'''. Left Uppsala, Sweden heavily indebted during 1769, attended a baptism as a witness in Saint Petersburg, Russia in August the same year. Started a hat factory in Saint Petersburg c. 1
2 CONC 774 with imperial privileges. Churchwarden (usher, Swedish: ''kyrkvärd'') in Santa Catarina parish, Saint Petersburg 1783-87. Died, probably in Moscow, by the end of 1805. The wife is titled widow at 1806-07-08.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
