1 OCCU Master hatter, journeyman. Hattmakare, gesäll
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Borg, Johannes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1741-11-30
2 CONT * ~ 1741-12-01
2 CONT * oo c. 1773-05-14, banns of marriage
2 CONT * † 1777-10
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Was a hatter by profession. Journeyman in Germany and Arkhangelsk''', from 1772-06-24 in Saint Petersburg, Russia. Master in Uppsala, Sweden after 11 years as a journeyman and apprentice. Banns of marriage with his cousin Ulrik
2 CONC a Borg in Klara, Stockholm, Sweden at 1773-05-14. Died in Stockholm, Sweden in October 1777.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
