1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Gustav Adolf (Gustav Ivanovich) Adolph Grosshopff''' was born on March 20, 1797 in Sankt Petersburg . His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-103388078 Johann Gottlieb Grosschopff] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-10338
2 CONC 8346 Anna Beata Östedt]. He was a Staatsrat, Direktor Zollamt Riga. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gustav Adolf (Gustav Ivanovich) married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34707282175 Emilia Theresie Therese Grosshopff]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697239904 Michail Friedrich von Grosschopff]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697300794 Karl Gustav von Grosschopff]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697231526 Eugen Edmund von Grosschopff]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697239878 Woldemar Gottlieb von Grosschopff]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697255477 Paul Rudolf von Grosschopff]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697239935 Lisinka-Elisabeth Anna Leocadie von Grosschopff]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 14, 1864, in Riga. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://dokumente.ios-regensburg.de/amburger/index.php?id=21150
