2 CONT '''Was a butcher in Stockholm, Sweden'''. Owned several farms in the Stockholm region. Registered with the butcher Per Andersson in Stockholm 1718-03-29, unregistered at 1721-10-06. Served Per Andersson and his widow Brita Tillman
2 CONC  during 14 years. According to notes, he had 6 sons and 6 daughters and is noted as having been debited for the exhumation of children twice, 1738-06-28 and 1743-02-07.
