2 CONC : Schwabe, 1982. [http://www.worldcat.org/issn/00367834 ISSN 0036-7834]. Online/PDF available at Konsortiums der Schweizer Hochschulbibliotheken c/o ETH-Bibliothek, SEALS, retrodigitized journals. DOI: [http://dx.doi.org/10.5169/s
2 CONC eals-80884 dx.doi.org/10.5169/seals-80884]. (accessed August 29, 2013).
