2 CONT '''Was a hatter by profession.''' To Saint Petersburg, Russia at 1782-07-06 as his fathers apprentice and journeyman. Returned to Sweden 1789. Hatter in Västerås 1792, to Köping 1801, to Hammar in Närke 1813, but then back to Väst
2 CONC erås again in 1815 since his wife gave birth to an illegitimate daughter.
