2 CONT
2 CONT '''Backman (1995:258)''' explains that the cousins Anna Lovisa Borg and [http://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Beata-%C3%96stedt/6000000010020016420 Anna Beata Östedt] in Saint Petersburg ‘married German’ but that it was through the lat
2 CONC ter, and specifically through her sister―the governess [http://www.geni.com/people/Carolina-Gustava-%C3%96stedt/6000000011077874825 Carolina Gustava]―that the usage of the Swedish language was preserved in the family for later gen
2 CONC erations. Still Lenin's sister [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Ilyinichna-Ulyanova/6000000010031350550 Maria] was able to write letters using good Swedish.
2 CONT
