2 CONC as however denied by the school board. In the service of the governor Mörner in Uppsala, and later as cook in Stockholm until 1804. To Saint Petersburg, Russia by 1820 and died there to Cholera (''nervfeber'') in Sta Catarina pari
2 CONC sh 1831-05-17. There was banns of marriage, probably in Finland, but with whom is unknown.
