2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eugen Edmund von Grosschopff''' was born on June 9, 1849 in Riga, Rīgas pilsēta, Riga, Latvia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-115728530 Gustav Adolf (Gustav Ivanovich) Adolph Grosshopff] and [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/profile-34707282175 Emilia Theresie Therese Grosshopff]. He was a Gutsbesitzer und Agronom. Landowner Agriculture/ Merchant
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697232126 Hedwig Henriette von Grosschopff]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697241885 Leonhard von Grosschopff];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697227706 Irma Elisabeth Malwine Kruse (Grosschopff)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697234834 Dr. Woldemar Roman von Grosschopff];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744927153 Ellis Alice Sophie Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697235201 Hedwig Blum]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697237486 Alexandra von Grosschopff]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697298179 Alice von Grosschopff];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697246473 Nina von Grosschopff];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697245907 Adolph Gustav von Grosschopff]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697240079 Katharina Maria von Grosschopff]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697240970 Dr. Eugen Michael von Grosschopff].  He died on June 11, 1912 in Waballen, Telsch, Litauen. 
2 CONT ----
