1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Novelius, Johan (Johannes)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * ~ 1661-03-17
2 CONT * oo c. 1706
2 CONT * † c. 1719
2 CONT * [ ] 1719-12-30
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Baptized in Västerås, Sweden 1661-03-17. Student at the ''Trivialskola'' by 1677''' (Latin: ''trivium'', school for education in latin, grammar and dialectics), gymnasium between 1678–81. Enrolled at Uppsala University in 1682-
2 CONC 03-01 and the Dala nation in 1682-03-02. Became a tutor, ordinained c. 1692 by the bishop of Skara, [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petrus_Johannis_Rudbeckius_%28biskop%29 Petrus Johannis Rudbeckius]. Preacher (Swedish: ''brukspredi
2 CONC kant'') at Leufsta bruk ([http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%B6vstabruk Lövstabruk]) 1697 and buried at 1719-12-30 in Tolfta, Tierp, Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
