1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Borg, Carl Gustaf'''
2 CONT * * 1795-01-19
2 CONT * † after 1828
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Was a hatter apprentice''' in Köping, Västerås, Stockholm and Eskilstuna. Church duty 1824 for breaching the sabbath, convicted at 1827-08-28 in Västerås kämnärsrätt (''camerarius'', English: ''treasury'', an old form of court 
2 CONC of law in Sweden) on grounds of theft and the destruction of other peoples fences. Farmhand at the drayman Ågren in Stockholm, Hedvig Elenora, by December 1827.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT * Backman, Christina. “Lenins svenska anor.” ''Släkt och Hävd'' №1 (1995): 253–273, p. 271.
