1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ульянов, Илья Николаевич''' — '''Ulyanov, Ilya Nikolayevich'''
2 CONT >Wikipedia: [http://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ili%C3%A0_Nikol%C3%A0ievitx_Uli%C3%A0nov ca] [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilja_Nikolajewitsch_Uljanow de] [http://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilja_Uljanov et] [http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ili%
2 CONC C3%A1_Uli%C3%A1nov es] [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilya_Ulyanov en] [http://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilja_Uljanov eo] [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilia_Nikola%C3%AFevitch_Oulianov fr] [http://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilia_Nicolaevici
2 CONC _Ulianov ro] [http://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A3%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2,_%D0%98%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%8F_%D0%9D%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87 ru] [http://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilja_Uljanov fi] [http:
2 CONC //sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilja_Nikolaevitj_Uljanov sv]
