1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Иван Дмитриевич Веретенников работал в 1861—1864 гг. в 
2 CONT Пензенском дворянском институте вместе с И. Н. Ульяновым.
2 CONT Full text of "Зубов А.Н. (отв. ред.) Симбирский вестник."
2 CONT archive.org›stream/Simbirskij_vestnik_Vypusk_3/…https://archive.org/stream/Simbirskij_vestnik_Vypusk_3/Зубов%20А.Н.%20%28отв.%20ред.%29%20Симбирский%20вестник.%20Историко-краеведческий%20сборник.%20Выпуск%20III%20%5B1996%5D_djvu.t
2 CONC xt
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Veretennikov, Ivan Dmitrievich'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ivan Dmitrievich Veretennikov was a Latin teacher''' at the Perm High School. There he befriended [http://www.geni.com/people/Srul-Moishevich-Blank/6000000010019232673 Aleksandr Dmitrievich Blank], who had taken a position as d
2 CONC octor in the school, a year after his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Ivanovna-Grosschopff/6000000010019081631 Anna Ivanovna] had died. Ivan later married Aleksandr's eldest daughter, [http://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Aleksan
2 CONC drovna/6000000010019168010 Anna]. Eventually Veretennikov became inspector at Perm Nobles’ Institue. It was on a visit to her married sister’s home in Perm that [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Alexandrovna-Blank/6000000010018910
2 CONC 359 Maria Blank] met the mathematics teacher at the Institute, [http://www.geni.com/people/Ilya-Nikolayevich-Ulyanov/6000000010018994260 Ilya Ulyanov], her future husband.
