1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Margareta'''
2 CONT * * c. 1688
2 CONT * ~ 1688-03-10
2 CONT * † before 1745
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Was a nursemaid'''. Crippled in the feet 1710. Granted the permission to beg 1737, noted as a bosuns widow by 1738, blind, and being 50 years of age. Present in the pauper register (Swedish: ''fattiglängd'') of 1741 but not in 
2 CONC 1745. The register for June-October 1742 is missing. Is the likely ''Margareta Hansdotter'' who married the bosun ''Olof Höök'' in 1723-12-31.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT * Backman, Christina. “Lenins svenska anor.” ''Släkt och Hävd'' №1 (1995): 253–273, p. 265.
