2 CONT '''Mark first met [http://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Ilyinichna-Ulyanova/6000000010030450923 Anna] in 1893 when they joined the Social-Democratic Party in Moscow'''. Their common interests established a marital bond which may have b
2 CONC een more pragmatic than romantic. Nevertheless, it was a congenial relationship. Anna's family treated him like a blood relative, and he in turn adopted them. Seven years older that [http://www.geni.com/people/Vladimir-Ilyich-Ulya
2 CONC nov/6000000010018573170 Volodya], his mature advice as well as assistance in looking after [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Alexandrovna-Blank/6000000010018910359 Maria Alexandrovna], were invaluable.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
