2 CONT * Hamilton-Dann, Mary. ''Vladimir and Nadya: The Lenin Story''. New York: International Publishers, 1998.
2 CONT * Service, Robert. ''Lenin: a biography''. Cambridge: Belknap Press of Harvard University Press, 2000.
