1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Fritz Wilhelm Kruse''' was born on February 9, 1900 in Eydelstedt, Niedersachsen, Germany. He was a Vermessungsingenieur, öffentl. best. Vermessings-Ingenieur. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fritz married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697227706 Irma Elisabeth Malwine Kruse (Grosschopff)]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697238679 Horst Kruse]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697222329 Liselotte Friederike Elisabeth Schultheiß]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34702963020 Günter Kruse]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 4, 1988, in Barnstorf, Lower Saxony, Germany. 
2 CONT ----
