1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Liselotte Friederike Elisabeth Schultheiß''' was born on 6, 1929 in Diepholz, Lower Saxony, Germany. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697227972 Fritz Wilhelm Kruse] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697227706 
2 CONC Irma Elisabeth Malwine Kruse (Grosschopff)]. She was a Lehrerin. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Liselotte married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697230911 Hans Max Schultheiß]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697217013 Susanne Irma Schultheiß]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34697236873 <private> Schultheiß]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7, 1998. 
2 CONT ----
