1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Alfred Alexander Burchard''' was born on August 23, 1870 in Rīga, Kreis Riga / Рижский уезд, Лифляндская губерния, Российская империя. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695208874 Mathias Eugen* Ferdinand Burchard
2 CONC ] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663905573 Luise Rosalie Auguste* Burchard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Alexander married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211194 Selina Burchard] in August 1896 in Riga, Rīgas pilsēta, Riga, Latvia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34737541779 Lilly Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744927235 Valter Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744927154 Harold Burchard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1955 in Wahnebergen, Dörverden, Niedersachsen, Germany. His family had an idyllic life in Riga, Latvia as their family lived in that county for Centuries until World War II broke out and The Russian Army was coming into
2 CONC  Latvia and no choice was given to these families, difficult when for centuries they lived and called Latvia their home. His son, [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744927154 Harold Burchard].was killed the way to Germany, while in G
2 CONC otenhafen, Pomerania, Poland,  shot in the streets by Polish Partisans in 1945. He died just 10 years later in Wahnebergen, Dörverden, Niedersachsen, Germany never again to see his homeland of Riga, Latavia. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT --------------------
