2 CONT '''Lilly Meyer Labastille (Burchard)''' was born on April 20, 1907, in Riga, Kreis Riga, Poland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211179 Alfred Alexander Burchard] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211194 S
2 CONC elina Burchard]. 
