1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Крупский, Игнатий Андреевич''' — '''Krupski, Ignatius Andreevich'''
2 CONT * * 1794.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Nobleman in the Volhynia province''', Ukraine. Graduated in philosophy from the Volyn' Theological Seminary in 1814. Participated in the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decembrist_revolt Decembrist revolt] (Russian: ''Восстание д
2 CONC екабристов'') 1825-12-14 in Saint Petersburg, Russia. After the massacre on the rebels, he was expelled from the Vilna province of Kazan under secret police surveillance.
