1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Luise Rosalie Auguste* Burchard''' was born on December 29, 1833, in Libau, Liepāja, Liepājas pilsēta, Liepājas pilsēta, Latvia and was baptized on February 11, 1834, in Libau St. Trinitatis, Liepāja, Liepājas pilsēta, Liepājas
2 CONC  pilsēta, Latvia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34662706976 Hermann Diedrich Huecke] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34662706891 Anna Elisabeth Huecke]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Luise Rosalie Auguste* married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695208874 Mathias Eugen* Ferdinand Burchard] on September 2, 1860, in Liepāja, Liepājas pilsēta, Liepājas pilsēta, Latvia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695210713 Eugen Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695208907 Oskar Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695210886 Viktor Wladimir Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211031 Anna Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211086 Paul Theodor Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695211179 Alfred Alexander Burchard];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695207061 Alexander Julius Burchard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 18, 1910 in Riga, Latvia. 
2 CONT ----
