1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Cyrill Irwin Ferrall, II''' was born on March 6, 1918 in Passaic, Passaic County, NJ, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740391382 Cyrill Irwin Ferrall, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740391
2 CONC 385 Ida Charlotte Ferrall (Neill)]. He was a Civil Engineer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cyrill married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740391383 Marion Irene Sietsma] in 1948 in Franklin Lakes, New Jersey. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740391387 Richard Irwin Ferrall]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753347721 Ronald Arthur Ferrall]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753347722 Barbara Irene Ferrall]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753347723 Barrett Edward Ferrall]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cyrill married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709266998 Ruth Martin Burchard (Stephens)] on June 22, 1974. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 14, 1978 in Houston, Harris Co., Texas, USA, Houston, Harris County, TX, United States from Cancer and was buried on August 17, 1978 in Houston National Cemetery, Houston, Harris County, Texas, Houston, Harris, T
2 CONC X, Harris. 
2 CONT ----
