2 NOTE Everyone complained, grandma https://www.geni.com/people/Julia-Stephens/6000000075441805825 talked constantly, from the time she woke, till the time she went to bed. She did, but I remember much of the many one-sided conversations
3 CONC . Good information, if you filter out some, she talked about our family. When I've been working on her family genealogy I recognize the many names of the people she spoke about. Much of what she said was ignored by many, but not m
3 CONC e. I loved her dearly. Every person in the family unit has a special place. 
2 NOTE I guess everyone came to see me, the new baby in the family. My sister was feeling left out, she used to be the baby....
