2 CONC  Vera Juanita Mann]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34708696546 Suzan Martin] on December 11, 1971 in Houston, Harris County, Texas, United States and they divorced on November 6, 1975, in Houston, Harris County, Texas, United States. T
2 CONC ogether they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722172002 Michon Anne Odum]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725357426 Donna Charlene Cornett] on January 1, 1983, in Harris County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725357431 Chri
2 CONC stie Marie Odum]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725357432 Matthew J Odum]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard died of cancer on December 7, 2024 in Caldwell, Burleson County, Texas, US. 
2 CONT
