2 CONC et Henrietta Nixon Stephens on 12 Jun 1883 • Guadalupe Co., Texas, USA,  the daughter of Capt. Robert Thomas Nixon and Laura Ann Wood Nixon. Margaret and William's  children were 1) Ora Mae Stephens Brewer 1885-1950 2) Robert Nixo
2 CONC n Stephens 1886-1955 3) James Edgar Stephens 1888-1962 4) Irma Nixon Stephens Johnson 1889-1975
