2 CONT '''Irma Nixon Johnson''' was born on December 2, 1890, in Luling, Caldwell County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333436 William Bell Stephens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333416 M
2 CONC argaret Henrietta Stephens]. She was a Housewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Irma married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716574919 Lansing Burroughs Johnson]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716575002 Dorothy Mae Landers]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716575045 Robert Samuel Johnson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716574601 Margaret Sue Griffith]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Lawton, Comanche County, Oklahoma, United States from Heart and was buried there. 
