1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ora Mae Brewer''' was born on January 22, 1885, in Luling, Caldwell County, Texas, USA, Guadalupe County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333436 William Bell Stephens] and [https://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/profile-126333416 Margaret Henrietta Stephens]. She was the oldest child of the four children. Her brothers and sisters looked up to her, she is pictured with them. 
2 CONT
2 CONT "An Older Sister is a friend and a defender,  - a listener, a conspirator, a counselor, and a sharer of delights, And of sorrows too"   -Pam Brown
2 CONT
