1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Robert Nixon Stephens''' was born on November 2, 1896, in Guadalupe County, Texas, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333436 William Bell Stephens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333416 Marga
2 CONC ret Henrietta Stephens]. Editorial writer, author.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717929122 Josephine Martha Webster] on April 18, 1916, in Galveston, Galveston County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717929124 Addie Lee Martha Stephens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717929125 Robert Nixon Stephens, Jr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 20, 1955, in Pueblo, Pueblo County, Colorado, United States.
2 CONT ----
