2 CONT
2 CONT Alton married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453386 Sallie Elizabeth Lancaster (Robertson)]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453389 Wyley Robertson Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alton married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453384 Bessie Mae Robinson] on February 17, 1925, in Bastrop, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453390 Alton Lee Lancaster, II]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453388 Edna Jerry Pearl Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
