2 CONT '''Kathleen Field Bland, Bascom''' was born on September 27, 1897, in Manor, Travis Co., TX. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939849 Henry Edgar Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278768 Mary Rebe
2 CONC cca Trigg]. She was a University of Texas Asst. Dean of Women. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kathleen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816323202 Howard A. Bland, Jr] in May 1917 in San Antonio, Texas, USA. Her husband divorced her in 1922 because she insisted on finishing her college degree. He believed a woman's p
2 CONC lace was in the home being a homemaker. They were divorced.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kathleen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816323203 Bascom Lee Wilson Md,].  Col. Wilson understood the Lancaster women, as being independent-minded. He supported her work. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34816323204 Mary Jane Wilson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 1, 1972, in Dallas, Collin, Texas, United States, and was buried in Arlington National Cemetery, Arlington, Arlington County, Virginia, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
