1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''William Thomas Nixon''' was born on October 31, 1853 in Guadalupe County, Texas, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961279 Captain Robert Thomas Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333375
2 CONC  Laura Ann Nixon (Wood)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 12, 1854 age 6 months in Guadalupe County, Texas, United States. and was buried in Old Nixon Cemetery, Guadalupe, Texas. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''*
2 CONT
2 CONT "Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956
