2 CONC hy he purchased a ranch in Medina county and moved there during the same year of his retirement.
2 CONT
2 CONT After eleven years of ranch life, Dr. Nixon moved to Austin in 1928 and then back to his old home in Gonzales in 1931, where he resided until death.
2 CONT
