1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Steven "Steve" Harrison Nixon''' was born on January 24, 1859, in Guadalupe County, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961279 Captain (CSA), Robert Thomas Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-12
2 CONC 6333375 Laura Ann Nixon]. He was a Rancher, Merchant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Steven married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760688711 Mary Adeline Gillespie] on November 5, 1889, in Graham, Arizona, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760688712 Robert Allen Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013334 Laura Elmira Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013336 Bertha Bell McColpin (Nixon)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013337 Adeline Addie Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013338 Joseph Steve Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 20, 1936, in Hot Springs, San Miguel, New Mexico, USA and was buried after November 20, 1936 in Hot Springs Cemetery, Truth or Consequences, Sierra County, New Mexico, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082553272&view=1up&seq=11
