2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Stephen "Steve" Harrison Nixon''' was born Jan 14, 1859 Guadalupe County, Texas to Captain Robert Thomas Nixon and Laura Ann Nixon (Woods). He died November 20, 1936 in Hot Springs, New Mexico. He married Mary Adeline Gillespie
2 CONC  on November 5, 1889, she was born Sept. 24, 1874vin Greenfield, Missouri. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Robert Allen Nixon born Sept. 10, 1890, married Ora Cox Aug. 8, 1929 Hollis Ok.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Laura Elmira (Parker) Nixon born Silver City New Mexico Jul 9, 1892, married Joe Watts Parker June 4, 1913 six children born this marriage, prematurely, all buried in Alpine, TX Ranchman. Residence Miles, TX
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Bertha Belle Nixon born Solomonville, AZ  Sep. 21, 1894, died Jan 28, 1939 Hot Springs, NM married Wilson McColpin Dec 19, 1918, Alpine, TX  born Feb. 13, 1890 Tascosa, TX Occup. Machinist Residence Los Angeles, CA  5-Children 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''*
