2 CONT '''Sarah Ann Stephens''' was born in 1829 in Georgia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717686826 Edward Stevens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717686867 Edith Edy Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928898 Adam Henry Thomas] on December 15, 1853 in Barren, Kentucky, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928901 Nancy Ellen Riddle]; [ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/profile-34717928900 Joseph Stevenson Thomas]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725255242 Narcissus Thomas]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725255243 James A Thomas]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725255241 Sar
2 CONC ah Or Sallie B Thomas]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725255244 Willis E Thomas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on November 10, 1906 in Kentucky, USA. 
