1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Margaret Sue Griffith''' was born on September 11, 1916, in Coleman, Coleman County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716574919 Lansing Burroughs Johnson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-
2 CONC 34716574883 Irma Nixon Johnson]. She was a Housewife. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716574454 George Oliver Griffith, Jr.]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717931375 George Oliver Griffith, III];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716530647 Margaret Sue Roth];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34718114895 R. Lansing Griffith]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 7, 1992, in Tulsa, Tulsa County, Oklahoma, the United States from cancer, and was buried there. 
2 CONT ----
