1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Bingham Trigg, Jr''' was born on July 5, 1874, in Austin, Travis County, Texas, Austin, Travis County, Texas, United States. ; son of  [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278759 Colonel Bingham Trigg] and [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rofile-34678278443 Frances “Fannie” Russell Trigg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on July 17, 1875, in Austin, Texas as an infant. He was the second child of five children. He was buried at Live OakCemetery, Travis County. Texas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''''Children of Col Bingham Trigg and Frances 'Fannie" Trigg (Field) '''''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Mary "Mollie" Rebecca Lancaster (Trigg) born Sept. 24, 1869, married Henry Edgar Lancaster, Nov. 16, 1886
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Bingham Trigg, Jr.; born July 5, 1874; died July 17, 1875, * subject, died at age 1 yrs old.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.. Julia Bingham Kleine (Trigg) married 1 William C. Kleine 2, William S. Cauthorn
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.. Fannie Field Coopwood (Trigg) married Edward B. Coopwood
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Rosa Sue Flowers (Trigg) married M. G. Flowers
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Trigg Field Genealogy- "Lancaster From Virginia to Texas" Mary Nixon Rogers, published 1987.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Burial Records State of Texas, Travis County, Bingham Trigg, Jr was born July 5th, 1874 to parents Colonel Bingham Trigg and Frances FannieRussell Field Trigg. He died July 17, 1875, and was buried at Live Oak Cemetery on July 1
2 CONC 8, 1875. section 1, lot 296.  He is in a marked grave or it shows B Trigg.   Information from genealogy book Lancaster Virginia to Texas.[ https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/201683599/bingham-trigg]
2 CONT
