1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Julia Bingham Kleine Cauthorn''' was born on October 7, 1875, in Austin, Travis, Texas, USA, Austin, Travis County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278759 Colonel Bingham Trigg, (CSA)] 
2 CONC and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278443 Frances Russell Trigg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Julia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678301349 William C. Kleine] on January 17, 1900, in Caldwell, Burleson County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722670495 William C. Kleine]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722670397 Colonel Bingham Trigg Kleine]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Julia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722670297 William Broadus Cauthorn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 16, 1955, in Gonzales County, Texas, United States of America, Gonzales County, Texas, United States, and was buried after in Gonzales, Gonzales County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
