1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Frances Lancaster (Lewis)''' was born on July 8, 1849, in Culpeper, Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-89692250 Alfred Brown Lewis] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-90491733 Martha James Colvin]. She
2 CONC  was a School Teacher and Homemaker. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939849 Henry Edgar Lancaster] on December 10, 1878, in Lockhart, Tx. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964664 Frances William Lancaster];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743699754 John Alfred Lancaster];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964669 Henry Edgar Lancaster, I MD];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743699755 Francis James Lancaster]. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She died on January 13, 1886, in Lockhart, Caldwell, Texas, the USA from Complications of Childbirth and was buried at The Manor Cemetery in Manor, Travis County, her youngest child[https://www.geni.com/profile-34743699755 Francis
2 CONC  James Lancaster]], is buried beside her. 
2 CONT ----
