2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dr. Henry Edgar Lancaster''' was born on March 30, 1884 in Lockhart, Caldwell, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939849 Henry Edgar Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964659 Frances 
2 CONC Fannie Lancaster (Lewis)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edgar married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968024 Ellen Wooldridge Waggener] on Dec. 3,  1909, in Austin, TX. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968033 Elizabeth Ross Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968034 Edgar Henry Lancaster, Jr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edgar married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968023 Edith Cecile Ujffy Lancaster] on March 24, 1920. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968036 Lewis Lancaster];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968035 John Harris Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 13, 1949, and was buried in Glenwood Cemetery in Houston, Harris, Texas, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- '''The University of Texas Year Book Quote''' from Uncle Edgar Lancaster, "Don't throw physic to the dog, The dog might have value" explanation for the world... Dogs don't mind being in a laboratory, whereas cats really don't
2 CONC  like it. .... Dot-Physics ... added by his great-niece, Suzan Martin[https://www.geni.com/people/Suzan-Martin/6000000062707328387]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Education'''
2 CONT * University of Texas Health Science Medical Degree 1909;-  Alpha Mu PI Omega;
2 CONT *  Senior Class President 1909 Medical Department, Academic Department,
2 CONT *  Bachelors of Science 1905,* University of Texas 
2 CONT *  President Junior Class, 04
2 CONT *  Awarded "T" for championships in gymnastics 2003; 
2 CONT *  Rice University undergrad 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Physcian and Surgeon'''  Physician and Surgeon 1919,  Medical Advisor and To The Committee for Outdoor Sports 
2 CONT * '''On the staff as Physician and Surgeon;''' 
2 CONT * Memorial Hospital, Houston, Texas 
2 CONT * Norsworthy Hospital, Surgery, Houston, Texas  Kress Medical Building, and office at 1417 Holman Ave, Houston, Texas
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Memberships and offices held''' 
2 CONT * Harris County Medical Association
2 CONT * Texas State Medical Association
2 CONT * South Texas District Medical Association
2 CONT * Houston Country Club Board Member
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
