1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT When Mason Edward Lancaster was born on December 7, 1855, in Jackson, Alabama, his father, John, was 28 and his mother, Mary, was 26. His family moved to Manor, Travis County, Texas in 1856, his father was a farmer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mason was a merchant and pharmacist. He also was a real estate broker. He married Ann Alabama Lancaster (Callihan) on July 26, 1881, in Lockhart, Texas. They had six children in 13 years. He died on June 14, 1943, in Austin, Texas
2 CONC , at the age of 87, and was buried in Lockhart, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mason Edward Lancaster''' was born on December 7, 1855, in Bellefonte, Jackson County, Alabama. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964660 John Nathaniel Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964663 
2 CONC Mary Ann Lancaster (Jones)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mason married [https://www.geni.com/profile-121666892 Ann Alabama Callihan] on July 26, 1881, in Lockhart, Caldwell, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762583350 Roy Edward Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762583348 Mary Irene Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762583349 Lucy Zelia Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762583351 Lelia Lee Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762583352 Linda Lancaster, PhD]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-121014094 Mabel Ann Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 14, 1943, in Austin, Travis, Texas, USA, Austin, TX, United States and was buried in Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, United States of America. 
