1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Josiah Joe Lee Lancaster''' was born on January 31, 1864, in Manor, Travis County, Texas, United States of America. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964660 John Nathaniel Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC profile-34715964663 Mary Ann Lancaster (Jones)]. He was a pharmacist and merchant.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Joe married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764097629 Laura Blake Lancaster (Carothers)] on December 22, 1892, in Manor, Travis County, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764097630 Robert Lee Lancaster, PhDI]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764097632 Howard Erwin Lancaster, MD,I]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764097631 Blake Nathaniel Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on December 26, 1947 in San Antonio, Bexar, Texas, United States and was buried in Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, United States of America, Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, United States. 
