2 CONT Patricia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743704610 Homer Alvin Smith] on December 1, 1972, in Travis, Texas, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Patricia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743704609 Victor Metz Carrington]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT #   [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743704612 Rebecca Louise Carrington];  
2 CONT #   [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743704613 Victor Giles Carrington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 15, 2004, in Austin, Travis County, Texas, USA and was buried on July 19, 2004. 
