1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richard Curry Giles, I''' was born on December 15, 1932, in Austin, Travis, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743704541 Frank Curry Giles, I.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939857 Pearl Russe
2 CONC ll Giles]. He was an Attorney, College Professor, Private Practice 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744052793 Saralu Couch]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744052801 Hollyce Chareen Giles]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744052802 Catheri
2 CONC ne Lynn Giles-Miller]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744052803 Frank William Giles]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 23, 2004, in Grapevine, Tarrant, Texas, USA and was buried at Bluebonnet Hills Memorial Park Cemetery, Grapevine, Texas
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Occupation'''
2 CONT * Allstate Insurance 40 years
2 CONT * '''University of Texas, Arlington, Texas Campus, Professor,  Texas Insurance Law''' 
2 CONT *''' Tarrant County Community College Professor Texas Insurance''' 
2 CONT *''' Private Practice, Attorney, Grapevine, Texas'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Education''', 
2 CONT * Southern Methodist University, until 1956 then transferred to University of Texas, Austin after marriage. 
2 CONT * The University of Texas, Austin Graduated Bachelor of Law degree Obituary[https://www.newspapers.com/clip/37480957/obituary_for_richard_curry_giles/]
