2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1930 - Harlingen, Cameron, Texas
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1935 - Harlingen, Cameron, Texas
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1940 - Justice Precinct 3, Austin, Tract 6, Travis, Texas
2 CONT * Lancaster From Virginia To Texas by Mary Nixon Rogers, published 1987 
