2 CONT '''Mary Rebecca Spencer Lemon''' was born on April 12, 1924, in Houston, Harris, Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939927 Henry Conoly Spencer] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715939854 Mollie Edn
2 CONC a Spencer]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 13, 1998, in Boone, Watauga, North Carolina, USA, and was buried after February 13, 1998, in Blowing Rock, Watauga County, North Carolina, United States of America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was named after her grandmother Mary Rebecca Lancaster Trigg[https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Mollie-Rebecca-Lancaster-Trigg/6000000036572277187?through=6000000075572680015] Nickname for Mary was "Mollie", confusion in the fam
2 CONC ily for her mother's first name, Rebecca Lemon (Spencer) mother's birth name was Mary "Mollie"  Edna,  Lancaster. They named a grandchild Mollie in memory of our great-grandmother, which was her nickname. 
