1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alex and Edith's first home was where Edith had gone to school. Laurie was born their. They moved to "Ocean View" where Keith, Mavis and Eileen were born. The homestead burnt down while the Lynch family was on holi
2 CONC day. In about 1916 the family moved to Casey's property, situated on the town side of the Whiritoa Post Office. They later moved to the next house along the road (where G. W. Arcus now lives). Then they moved to "Holderdale" where
2 CONC  Colin was born on 1928. After the fire at "Ocean View", Bert Garner built a new house and farmed the property. The Lynch family left "Holderdale" and moved to Whangaehu for four yeras, then moved to Putiki before returning to Eli
2 CONC zabeth Garner's property (the modern "Penrose") opposite the 5th Kaitoke School in 1938. They owned this property until 1946 and then moved to Wanganui. Colin Lynch moved to "Callart" at Marangai at Marangai in 1973.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT b. Cunniball d. BDM Online ... 1971/32068	Lynch	Alexander De-Wolf Cunnabell	84Y
