1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Carl Zapp''' was born on September 17, 1868 in Germany. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721793786 Julius Zapp] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721793796 Isabella Emilie Zapp]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34654193471 Emilie* Antonie Zapp (Burchard)] on November 13, 1904 in Rīga, Rīgas pilsēta, Rīgas pilsēta, Latvia. Together they had the following children: Walter and Edgar
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://raduraksti.arhivi.lv/objects/1:4:11:2055:2474:23891#&gid=1&pid=75
2 CONT
2 CONT Foto - Tallinna Linna Politseiülem. Ajutiste ...; TLA.186.1.571; 1922 http://www.ra.ee/dgs/browser.php?tid=260&iid=124031977557&img=tla0186_001_0000571_00025_t.jpg&tbn=1&pgn=2&prc=30&ctr=0&dgr=0&lst=2&hash=bd426fec559f9883ac63a281
2 CONC 1aa31e08
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation:	Karl had been a traveling representative of a manufacturing concern throughout the late 1800's and into the early 1900's. Circa 1895 Marriage:	Marriage to: Emilie Antonia Ida Zapp (born Burchard) Nov 13 1904
2 CONT  Rīga, Rīgas pilsēta, Rīgas pilsēta, Latvia Departure:	Family exiled as German aliens in Baltic Tsarist Russia during WWI. Circa 1913
2 CONT  Ural Region, Siberia Departure:	After WWI, was separated from family for a few years. Circa 1919
2 CONT  Revell (Talinn), Estonia Arrival:	Reunited with family. Circa 1921
2 CONT  Riga, Latvia Death:	"Brandenburg/Havel" 1945
2 CONT  Brandenburg, Germany
