1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''William Wood''' was born on January 8, 1796, in Randolph County, North Carolina, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333232 Penuel Wood] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690553336 Sarah Wood].  William mar
2 CONC ried [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333366 Henrietta Denman (Andrews)] on March 23, 1826 in Randolph, North Carolina, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34621822450 Harriss Kimball Wood]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743332021 James Madison Wood]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333375 Laura Ann Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743332020 Elmira Wood]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743332019 Alexander Norman Wood]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743332023 William Barney Wood]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743332022 Sirone Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1835 in Randolph County, North Carolina and he was buried there. The recent discovery of court documents for his minor children proves the death date of 1835. Evidently, earlier genealogists found the court records but 
2 CONC not all of them or didn't read the first page.  [https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/9061/images/007384189_00870?usePUB=true&pId=1329889]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References"
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/9061/images/007384189_00870?usePUB=true&pId=1329889]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----Wood Geneaology pps161-172
2 CONT *"Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956 [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082553272&view=1up&seq=11 Hathitru
2 CONC st]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://newbooksinpolitics.com/political/the-early-nixons-of-texas/]
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/111701831/person/430099428390/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 5 2019, 3:17:36 UTC''
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/111701831/person/430099428390 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 7 2020, 4:53:25 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/261983991/william-wood Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 5 2023, 9:43:08 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT William Wood was born Jan 8, 1795, to parents Penual Wood and Sarah Kimball, he married Henrietta Andrews on March 23, 1826, in 1835 Randolph County, North Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrietta was a brave young widow, left with 6 young surviving children. She had family nearby in Randolph County,  but when her daughter Laura Ann married and moved to Texas  Henrietta and her children also moved to Guadalupe Cou
2 CONC nty, Texas. On May 5, 1854, she re-married 2) Morgan Gilbert Denman  they had one 1 child Judge Leroy Gilbert Denman 1855-1916
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT 1. Harriss Kimball Wood 1827-1923 m Mary Jane Parchman
2 CONT 2.  James Madison Wood 1829-1878 m Laura Ann Ledbetter
2 CONT 3. Laura Ann Nixon (Wood) 1832-1872 M Capt Robt. Thomas Nixon
2 CONT 4. Sirone Wood  1833-1833
2 CONT 5. Alexander  Norman Wood 1833-1869 
2 CONT 6. Elmira Andrews Foster (Wood) 1834-1807 m Joel Moore Foster
2 CONT 7. William Barney Wood 1835-1821 m Kezia McAnelly
2 CONT
2 CONT Ref. Probated Will, Census Records, marriage records, "The Early Nixon's of Texas" Published by Hertzog.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/261983991/william-wood Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projec
2 CONC ts/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 9 2025, 16:50:52 UTC''
