1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Henrietta Denman (Andrews)''' was born on January 25, 1809, in Randolph Co., North Carolina. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722035065 Richard Andrews] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-71155599 Martha Green Re
2 CONC avis]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrietta married [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333342 William Wood] on March 23, 1826, in Randolph, North Carolina, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34621822450 Harriss Kimball Wood];
