1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''2nd LT Alexander Norman Wood''' was born on November 15, 1833 in Randolph County, North Carolina, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34849177741 William Wood] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34849177743 Henri
2 CONC etta Andrews Denman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 18, 1869 in Belmont, Gonzales County, Texas, USA and was buried in Belmont Cemetery, Belmont,															Gonzales County,															Texas,																USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Son of William Kimball Wood and Henrietta (Andrews) Wood Denman. He was a Rancher, struck by lightning while working his cattle. His gravestone may be lost; the family moved his mother and stepfather's graves years later to The Ol
2 CONC d Nixon Cemetery in Kingsbury because of vandalism of gravestones.
