1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Pat Ireland Nixon, MD''' was born on November 29, 1883, in Texas, Guadelupe Co. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961279 Captain Robert Thomas Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717925392 Frances Amand
2 CONC a Nixon]. He was a Physician and Surgeon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Received his Bachelor of Science Degree, the University of Texas in 1905; and his Medical Degree from John Hopkins University Medical School. Texas Medical Association, President of Bexar County Texas County Medical Society, Texas
2 CONC  State Historical Society.
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687119550 Olive Gray Read] on July 3, 1912, in Texas, Wood, Mineola. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239776 Pat Ireland Nixon Md, Jr];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239774 Robert Read Nixon, MD];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239772 Benjamin Oliver Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239775 Thomas Andrews Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 18, 1965, in Texas, Bexar Co, San Antonio and was buried after November 18, 1965, in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, USA. 
2 CONT ----
