1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Zebulon Vance Nixon''' was born on October 7, 1887, in Nixon, Gonzales, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961279 Captain Robert Thomas Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717925392 Frances A
2 CONC manda Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Zebulon married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239082 Florence Virginia Anderson] on December 31, 1915, in San Antonio, Bexar, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239083 Frances Virginia Nixon];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239084 Dorothy Florence Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on July 4, 1965, in Yorktown, De Witt, Texas, USA and was buried after July 4, 1965 in Cuero, DeWitt County, Texas, United States of America. He was an Attorney.
2 CONT ----
