2 CONT * Views on Slavery [https://archive.org/stream/towardfreedomfor00hilt/towardfreedomfor00hilt_djvu.txt] Important note, The Nixons did not believe in Slavery, they were the first American immigrants to free their slaves, when slave
2 CONC s were listed on Census Reports they were living at the Nixon's and working for them for wages. The Nixon Family protected them. 
