1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==A Quaker in North Carolina to a Prominent Rancher in Texas==
2 CONT
2 CONT Picture the scene on a street corner in the village of Ashboro, North Carolina when the sun was just rising in the autumn of 1852, you would see the handsome young men mounting their horses, their oldest brother [https://www.geni.
2 CONC com/profile-34715961279 Captain Robert Thomas Nixon] age 25 yrs old seated with his new wife,  Laura Ann Nixon (Wood), at their new covered wagon drawn by a span of horses. Robert Thomas Nixon,https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928
2 CONC 407] and John Tinsley Nixon arrived in Guadalupe County too late for free state land. The first tract of 400 acres cost $800. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Tinsley Nixon raised cattle but was known for his fast horses. Many made it to the race tracks which were the Askey Family interest in Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Nixon family left the Quaker to the Methodist religion by the time they reached Texas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Tinsley Nixon''' was born on July 12, 1836, in Randolph County, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564215 Zachariah Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717925391 Sarah El
2 CONC izabeth Nixon (Thomas)]. He was a Ranchman, Farmer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928539 Lucinda Lou Elizabeth Askey] in 1867 in Gonzales, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743059685 Harrison Askey Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743059684 Kitty G Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743059683 Zeddie Elizabeth Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743059682 Julia A. Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 23, 1904, in Gonzales, Gonzales County, Texas, United States, and was buried after October 23, 1904, in Old Rancho Cemetery, Nixon, Gonzales County, Texas, United States. Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/m
2 CONC emorial/22276745/john-tinsley-nixon Find A Grave Memorial] -  
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
