1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''James William Nixon, MD''' was born on September 22, 1893, in Gonzales County, Texas, United States of America. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961280 James Wesley Nixon, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profil
2 CONC e-34722417449 Mary Nixon (King)]. He was a Physician and Surgeon, FBI. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435632 Julianna Stevens Nixon (Baker)] on October 4, 1921, in Bala, Lower Merion, Montgomery County, Pennsylvania, USA. Together they had five children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435635 Martha &quot;Patty&quot; Taliaferro (Nixon)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435634 James Wesley Nixon MD]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435636 Juliana Stevens Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435638 Mary &quot;Polly&quot; Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435637 Linda Worthington Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 4, 1980, and was buried in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, United States of America.
2 CONT ----
