2 CONT '''Luella Kenley (Nixon)''' was born on November 24, 1896, in Gonzales County, Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961280 James Wesley Nixon, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722417449 Mary Nixon
2 CONC  (King)]. 
2 CONT
