2 CONC 35194 Mary Lee Kenley]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435195 Luella Nixon Kenley]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 16, 1966, in San Antonio, Bexar, Texas, USA, and was buried after April 16, 1966, in Gonzales, Gonzales County, Texas, United States of America. 
