2 CONT '''Robert Leroy Nixon''' was born on September 11, 1892, in Wrightsboro, Gonzales, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961280 James Wesley Nixon, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722417449 Mary N
2 CONC ixon (King)]. Rancher cattle and Quarter Horses.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435267 Mildred Finks] on May 21, 1918. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435269 Sally Jane Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435268 Laura Ann Graham];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741435270 Mildred Blocher]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 5, 1943, in Austin, Travis, Texas, USA and was buried in Gonzales Masonic Cemetery [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/171503841/robert-leroy-nixon]
