1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Laura Ann Nixon''' was born on November 5, 1887, in Wrightsboro, Gonzales, Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961280 James Wesley Nixon, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742579245 Anne C. Nix
2 CONC on (King)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 18, 1888, in Wrightsboro, Gonzales, Texas, USA.[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/99403385/laura-annie-nixon] [https://billiongraves.com/grave/Anne-Laurie-Nixon/10449539?referrer=myheritage]
2 CONT
2 CONT Obit-Gonzales Inquirer Apr. 17, 1890
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Nixon's little girl died Sunday, 13th at 10 o'clock. She was taken over in the Forks of the river and laid by her mother. The old must die; the young may die.
2 CONT
2 CONT Going by "The Early Nixon's of Texas"  Dr. Pat Ireland Nixon was her father's brother, plus the fact we have the obituary her Death date as being April 13, 1890- Find a grave - I will send in a correction for Laura Ann Nixon Death
2 CONC  date - believe they confused with her mother's death year-  perhaps may be additional sibling buried, will research.  ---- Genealogy Book has death date April 1, 1890, but it must be a misprint. Her nickname was "Annie Laurie" as
2 CONC  her headstone reads. death and birthdate not readable. 
