2 CONT '''Dora Ann Nixon (Wilson)''' was born on December 28, 1870, in Tehuacana, Frio, TX, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dora married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961283 John Phillip Nixon] on February 3, 1887, in Tehuacana, Limestone, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745353019 Margaret Nora Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745353016 Mary Viola Mofield Melton (Nixon)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690044342 Hallie Laura McAnelly];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745353015 John Phillip Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745353017 Armour Dora Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 10, 1914, in Hondo, Medina, Texas, USA and was buried in Tehuacana Cemetery, Frio County, Texas, but after her husband's death, the top part of her headstone was moved to Yancy Cemetery, Medina County, TX  by h
2 CONC er husbands grave, but not her body. She has markers at both-  [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/18006575/dora-ann-nixon]	
2 CONT ----
