2 CONT '''Mary Viola Nixon''' was born on May 12, 1889, in Medina County, Texas. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961283 John Phillip Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745353008 Dora Ann Wilson].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008248 Henry Louis Mofield] on January 24, 1911, in Medina County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008249 Henry Elroy Mofield]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008251 Doris Mofield Hartman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008247 William Briscoe Melton] on August 15, 1918, in Yancy, Medina County, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008250 Ina Melton]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008253 William Alvin Melton]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750008252 Amy Melton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 5, 1973, in Hondo, Medina, Texas, USA, and was buried in Medina County, Texas, United States of America. 
