1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''John Phillip Nixon''' was born on October 19, 1901, in Yancey, Medina County, Texas, United States of America. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715961283 John Phillip Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-347
2 CONC 45353008 Dora Ann Nixon (Wilson)]. He was a Rancher. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796447 Eva Nixon (Ward)]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796448 Philip Ray Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796450 Joe Lee Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796449 Infant Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796451 Annette E Nixon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757796452 Nelimarie Nixon].
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 24, 1968, in Hondo, Medina, Texas, USA, and was buried after March 24, 1968, in Medina County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Education''' 
2 CONT *  Philips Exeter Academy - Prep School, his grandfather, Capt. Robert Thomas Nixon was concerned, although his children and grand-children were intelligent the Texas Schools were inferior to Virginia schools, he decided his child
2 CONC ren should attend Phillips Exeter Academy as prep for college and medical school. Future generations of our Nixon lineage followed this family tradition through the present day.[https://www.exeter.edu/]
2 CONT * Texas A&M University
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/18006675/john-philip-nixon] [https://www.newspapers.com/clip/43902803/obituary_for_john_p_nixon/] [https://www.newspapers.com/clip/3642604/the_hondo_anvil_herald/] Obituary list children - Pl
2 CONC ease Note: mistake in Nixon genealogy "Early Nixon of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, published by Hertzog 1958,  book list John Phillip Nixon, II father's wife as his wife and list no children. ---- proof of his children and correct
2 CONC  wife's name. I found the marriage certificate for his father's 2nd marriage and 2nd wife's death certificate.  John Phillip Nixon, II wife was Eva Ward ( Nixon) 
