3 TEXT When a Newspaper journalist made racist remarks about Dr. Nicholas Champion. He didn't give the time of day to the most racist comment-  he just asked The Houston Post to state "He was a native of Brownsville, Texas , he was not a
4 CONC  Spaniard, he was a Citizen of the United States". This I think speaks volumes of this man. He graduated top of his medical School Class at Tulane Medical School in New Orleans, LA. 
4 CONT The importance of the lesson is this, he was an American Citizen - period, a successful and respected man in Brownsville and Luling, Texas. The person who wrote this article probably didn't have a college degree., enough said. 
