1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nina Catherine Jackson (Champion)''' was born on November 6, 1883, in Luling, Caldwell, Texas, United States, Luling, Caldwell County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721943043 Nicholas Ch
2 CONC ampion MD I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721942469 Elmira Isabelle Champion]. Her husband owned a wholesale grocery business.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nina married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748678576 Charles Lafayette Jackson, I] on February 25, 1914, in Caldwell, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748678579 Marie Champion Jackson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748678581 Charles Lafayette Jackson, II]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748678582 Rosamond Champion Jackson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 11, 1953, from a lifetime of Heart Disease and Cirrhosis of the liver, and is buried at Buena Vista Burial Park in Brownsville, Cameron, Texas, USA.[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/155941618/nina-jackson]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
