2 CONT '''Harrison Garrett Wilson''' was born on April 26, 1865 in Collin County, TX, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34751920727 Levi Adamson Wilson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34751920731 Mary Jane 
2 CONC Rowland]. He was a Ranchman. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harrison married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807688 Viola Mae Nixon] in 1891. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741756081 Dora Wilson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741756080 Roland Wilson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741756082 Elbert Wilson]; 
