1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dora Mae Wilson''' was born on September 23, 1898, in Yancey, Medina, Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741756065 Harrison Garrett Wilson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807688 Viola Mae Wilso
2 CONC n (Nixon)]. She was a School Teacher and the favorite Aunt Dora to her many nieces and nephews. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 30, 1975, in Yancy, Medina County, Texas, USA, and was buried after April 30, 1975 in Yancey, Medina County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She attended the University of Texas and was a School Teacher in San Antonio, TX until retirement. She never Married.
2 CONT ----
