2 CONT '''Elbert Erskin Wilson''' was born on February 23, 1900, in Yancy, Medina, TX, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741756065 Harrison Garrett Wilson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807688 Viola Mae Wilso
2 CONC n (Nixon)]. He was a Rancher. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elbert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-118913036 Cornelia Wilson]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-118912974 Sam Earl Wilson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 15, 1950, in Medina, TX, United States, and was buried in Yancey, TX, United States. 
