1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Annie Elizabeth Nixon Ballard''' was born on February 21, 1873, in Guadalupe County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Annie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807690 Sam Houston Nixon] on June 24, 1891, in Seguin, Guadalupe County, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819061 Eunice Estelle Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819060 Margaret Lorena Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819062 Robert Stanley Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819063 John Harrison Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819064 Mabel Anne Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819065 Nicholas Champion Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819066 Thomas Edison Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819067 Betty Laverne Nixon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819068 Mary Louise Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Annie was separated or divorced from Sam Houston Nixon before 1900, he is on the Census living with his sister with their youngest children without her. She moved to California with the oldest children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Annie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819372 Thomas Ballard] circa 1936 in San Antonio, Bexar County, TX, United States  She divorced Sam Houston Nixon before 1900, and she was living with a few of their sons in Califor
2 CONC nia without him, he was in another Census with the other children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 19, 1937, in Precinct 7, Bexar, Texas, USA from a Brain Tumor and was buried in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
