1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Robert Stanley Nixon''' was born on August 19, 1901,  at the Nixon Ranch, Guadalupe County, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807690 Sam Houston Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773819057
2 CONC  Annie Elizabeth Nixon Ballard]. They were separated when he was born, he was raised by his single father at his Aunt https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Stephens/6000000012839840153?through=6000000012839917647 and uncle, https:/
2 CONC /www.geni.com/people/William-Bell-Stephens/6000000012839917647?through=6000000012839840153 Ranch. He most likely never knew his mother very well. She moved to California with two of her older children shortly after his birth. Divo
2 CONC rce was granted on the grounds of her desertion of her husband and young children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773823709 Ruth Nixon] on September 12, 1925, in Houston, Harris, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773823713 Roy Stanley Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34773823708 Marguerite Tanner]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 1, 1988, in Beaumont, Jefferson, Texas, USA, and was buried in Beaumont, Jefferson County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
