2 CONT '''Mary Anne Stevens (Clark)''' was born in 1774 in Andover, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765055185 William Clark Lt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34767308389 Rebecca Clark]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746801287 William James Stephens of Putnam County, GA] on June 10, 1822, in Frederick County, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717686826 Edward Wilkins Stevens]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763758285 Sarah Ann Stevens]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763758284 Mary Ann Stevens]. 
