1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''William James Stevens''' was born in 1771 in Loudoun, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532599 Edward Stevens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532594 Jemima Green]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746801300 Mary Stevens (Clark)] on June 10, 1822, in Frederick County, Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717686826 Edward Wilkins Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763758285 Sarah Ann Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763758284 Mary Ann Stevens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before August 5, 1833, in Putnam County, Georgia, USA. 
