2 CONC 80179829?through=6000000203848850826 married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017904 Hiram Billings] on March 24, 1864, in Wilkes, North Carolina, USA.  was most likely her cousin of the same name. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sarah Ann McNeil''' was born in 1822 in Wilkes County, North Carolina, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-36852746 John B. Kilby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-36853338 Nancy Annis Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34692447445 William H McNiel] on March 10, 1843, in Wilkes, North Carolina. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017906 Mary Jane McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34692447389 John H. McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017909 Byron McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017910 Benjamin Franklin McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824014529 Pinkney Marshall Pink McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017912 Thomas Andrew McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017911 Rachel Camilla McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824014530 Richard Ellison McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017907 Nancy Caroline McNeil];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34824017913 Thornton Sylvester McNeil]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1890 in Purlear, Wilkes County, North Carolina, USA, Purlear, Wilkes County, NC, United States, and was buried in New Hope Baptist Church Cemetery, Purlear,                                                              
2 CONC                                   Wilkes County,                                                                                                North C.
2 CONT
