1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Martha Rosa Steele''' was born in 1835 in Eufaula, Barbour County, Alabama, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964477 Henry Hill Field] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964468 Mary Russell Fiel
2 CONC d (Colvin)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278672 William M. Steele] on November 28, 1872, in Lockhart, Caldwell, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278674 Mary Sue Jarr
2 CONC ett (Steele)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 4, 1936, and was buried in Lockhart, Caldwell County, TX, United States.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Her father left an inheritance and her young husband was very successful as a Merchant and Banker for 50yrs.  [https://www.newspapers.com/clip/38749586/obituary_for_rosa_steele/]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-40001/familysearch-family-tree?itemId=95546779&action=showRecord FamilySearch Family Tree] via mother [http://www.geni.com/profile-126964468 Mary Russell Field (born Ca
2 CONC lvin)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 22 2015, 12:05:02 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-40001/familysearch-family-tree?itemId=95546779&action=showRecord FamilySearch Family Tree] via brother [http://www.geni.com/profile-34678278435 William Edward Field] by
2 CONC  [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 22 2015, 12:11:43 UTC''
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Rosa Mary Steele''' was born on November 30, 1845 in Eufaula, Barbour County, Alabama, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964477 Henry Hill Field] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964468 Mary Russell Col
2 CONC vin]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rosa married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745247535 William M Steele] on November 28, 1872 in Lockhart, Caldwell, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745247539 Mary Sue Steele].
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 4, 1936 in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, USA and was buried after August 4, 1936 in Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT They married very young by today's standard, this didn't stop her husband from quickly becoming a prominent Merchant prosperous Banker of Lockhart Texas with the inheritance of his father-in-law's estate to get the business starte
2 CONC d and have security for the future investments. They lived in a large home with maid service by census reports.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
