1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''William H. Trigg''' was born on November 27, 1838 in Saline County, Missouri, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715937635 John Anthony Trigg] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715937591 Rebecca W
2 CONC . Trigg]. He was a School Teacher, Farmer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741234376 Mary Frances Trigg (Williams)] in 1862 in Cooper, Missouri, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 14, 1917 in Houstonia Cemetery,  Houstonia, Pettis County, Missouri, USA, Pettis County, Missouri, United States. 
2 CONT ----
