2 CONT '''Ellen Wooldridge Lancaster''' was born on August 16, 1883 in Bowling Green, Warren County, Kentucky, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34689435895 Leslie Waggener, Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-34689435869 Dr. Frances L. Pendleton, PhD]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964669 Dr. Edgar Henry Lancaster, MD] on December 3, 1909 in Austin, Travis County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968033 Elizabeth Ross Lancaster, PhD];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743968034 Edgar Henry Lancaster, II, PhD]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 19, 1912 in Houston, Harris, Texas, USA from Endocarditis after Childbirth and was buried after in Austin, Travis County, Texas, United States of America. After her death, the children were sent to the Waggener 
2 CONC family to live. 
