1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Delilah Jones''' was born in 1810 in Tennessee, USA, Madison County, Alabama, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34735644123 Phillip Henry Armbrister] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722849223 Mar
2 CONC y Ambrister]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Delilah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722846723 Judge Moses Hare Jones, III]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964663 Mary Ann Lancaster]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821012 John W Jones]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821014 Hettie Melissa Jones]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821011 Joseph H Jones]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821013 Horace Jones]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821015 Laura F Jones]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34746821017 Maria Eleanor Jones]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1862 in Bellefonte, Jackson County, Alabama, USA, Jackson County, Alabama, United States and was buried in Bellefonte Cemetery, Bellefonte, Jackson County, Alabama, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Delilah Armbrister Jones married Judge Moses Jones in 1828. She was the daughter of  Phillip Henry Armbrister 1796-1850 and Mary Derrick Armbrister 1796-1850. Children
2 CONT * 1. Mary Ann Jones Lancaster 1829-1906 
2 CONT * 2. John W. Jones 1831-1864 
2 CONT * 3. Hettie  Melissa Jones 1834-1864 
2 CONT * 4. Joseph H. Jones 1836-1865 
2 CONT * 5. Horace Jones 1849-  Married Kate Cocke Nov 7, 1867, Perry AL.  
2 CONT * 6. Laura F. Jones 1852- 1934  
2 CONT * 7. Maria Eleanor Jones 1859-1915*  
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''References''' 
