2 CONT '''Mariah A. Branch Hudson''' was born on October 30, 1840 in Jones Plantation, Bellefonte,Jackson County, Alabama, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34722846723 Judge Moses Hare Jones, III] and [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/profile-34722847490 Delilah Jones]. 
