2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809967280 William Henry Branch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809967281 Lucy A Branch]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mariah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809964408 Alfred Baker Hudson] on November 15, 1870 in Hazen Prairie, Arkansas County, Arkansas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809965539 Walter Baker Hudson]; 
