2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809965540 Benjamin Alfred Hudson]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809965542 William McCan Hudson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 13, 1892 in Hazen, Prairie Co., Arkansas, USA and was buried after March 13, 1892 in Hazen Cemetery, Hazen, Prairie County, Arkansas, USA. 
