1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT When Roy Edward Lancaster was born on May 23, 1882, in Lockhart, Texas, his father, Mason, was 26 and his mother, Ann, was 20. He married Lula Blanche Lancaster (Mohle) on November 22, 1905. They had one  child during their marria
2 CONC ge, a son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sadly, he died from pneumonia at home October 16, 1918,when his great-uncle was a doctor https://www.geni.com/people/William-Lancaster-MD/6000000075596182910?through=6000000083372800840, two first cousins were doctors; https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/people/Lifford-Williamson-Lancaster-MD/6000000083372800840?through=6000000075596182910 and https://www.geni.com/people/Henry-Edgar-Lancaster-I-MD/6000000075596179877?through=6000000075572163430, his father was a pharmaci
2 CONC st, his great-uncle a pharmacist https://www.geni.com/people/Henry-Lancaster/6000000075572163430?through=6000000075596179877, his great-aunt was married to a well-known doctor .  He was brought up around the medical community with
2 CONC  knowledge, yet he didn't seek assistance. A lesson for us all of us. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a salesman for Grocery Supply  Company for the last 6 years of his life and lived in San Marcos, Hays County, Texas.  He was buried with his family in his hometown of Lockhart, Texas. His widow and son sold their home and p
2 CONC urchased a home close to family members in Lockhart, Texas where they lived for their lifetime. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He  was buried 1918, in Lockhart Municipal Burial Park, Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, USA.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/111137035/roy-e_-lancaster Find A Grave Memorial]  
