1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eugene Kenneth Adair''' was born on October 24, 1921, in Muskogee, Oklahoma, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763469031 Eugene Montgomery Adair] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763469032 Mary Margaret M
2 CONC urphy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugene married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763453388 Edna Jerry Pearl Lancaster (Adair)] on September 12, 1941, in San Marcos, Hays County, TX, United States. Together they had three children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-347
2 CONC 63454349 Darla Jean Adair]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34763454350 Dwayne Patrick Adair]. 
2 CONT ---
2 CONT He died on December 19, 2000, in Keller, Tarrant Co., Texas, and was buried, in Irving, Dallas County, Texas, United States of America.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/34801706/eugene-kenneth-adair Find A Grave Me
2 CONC morial] -  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Military''' 
2 CONT * Corporal in the US Army Air Force  Military Police during WWII
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Profession''' 
2 CONT * Owned Irving Playmates Nursery School for 25 years. 
2 CONT
