2 CONT * Release Date 1: 	16 Oct 1945
2 CONT * Rank: Corp. On  19 Oct 1945 - he re-enlisted in WWII Draft card attached -[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000151166085825] 
2 CONT
