1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Margaret Elizabeth Lancaster''' was born on February 13, 1929, in Brownsville, Cameron, Milam County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715959088 Mark Drake Jackman] and [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/profile-34715959091 Genevieve Elizabeth Jackman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715958885 Charles Carroll Lancaster] in 1950. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 27, 2012, in Harris County, Texas, United States and was buried in Houston, Harris County, Texas, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Palacios, Matagorda, Texas, United States
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1935 - Houston, Harris, Texas
