1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Timothy C. Lancaster, 66, of Cape Carancahua, passed away September 20, 2022.   He was born March 26, 1956 to the late Charles and Margaret Jackman Lancaster.  He loved fishing, gardening and his two beloved cats. 
2 CONC He was an excellent gardener and shared his bountiful produce with family, friends, and neighbors.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was preceded in death by his parents, and brother Thomas Lancaster. He is survived by his brother Ted Lancaster (Melodie); sister Kyle Swetlick (Paul); nephews Thomas and Timothy Lancaster, and nieces Tammy Tiedt and Heather Po
2 CONC lk.
2 CONT
2 CONT A Graveside Service will be held at 2:00 PM Sunday, September 25, 2022 at Palacios Cemetery with Matt Springfield officiating.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/243787579/timothy_charles-lancaster Find A Grave Memor
