2 CONT Birth:	Apr 11 1907 - Masthuggets Göteborg
2 CONT Residence:	Between 1936 and 1946 - Kullen Västra, Helsingborgs stadsförsamling (Maria), Malmöhus, Skåne, Sweden
2 CONT Marriage:	Apr 27 1932
