1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Penuel Wood, Sr.''' was born on January 22, 1772 in Edgecombe County, NC, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-32414220 Capt. William Wood] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-32414219 Martha Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Penuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690553336 Sarah Wood] in 1793 in Randolph County, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333342 William Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435141 Nancy Elizabeth Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34711003109 Serena Ridge];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435174 Jesse Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-126342634 Sarah or Sally Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-126342412 Penuel Wood, II];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435169 Martha Jane (Patsy) Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435170 Disey Elizabeth Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435172 Priscilla Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435177 Sarah Ann Elizabeth Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435178 Wiley Kimball Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725077217 Nancy Rachel Keerans]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Penuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34792580757 Martha Peggy Wood] circa 1821 in Randolph County, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34711003109 Serena Ridge];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435179 Jane Infant &quot;Jincy&quot; Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845435180 Rebecca Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on January 8, 1841 in Randolph County, NC, United States. 
