2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Sarah was born in 1775. She passed away in 1814. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Penuel  Wood, b Jan 22, 1772, d Jan 8, 1841. md. (1) Miss Smithson 
2 CONT and (2) Sarah Kimball.  According to Mrs. Burchard, who is a 
2 CONT descendant of the second marriage, Sarah Kimball was the daughter of 
2 CONT Buckner Kimball (b 1746, d 1812 in Granville Co. NC), who was a 
2 CONT Captain in the Revolution.  Buckner Kimball was the son of Peter 
2 CONT Kimball and Winnie Gilliam and the grandson of Joseph Kimball .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT REBECCA  WOOD, b Sept 6, 1773, md. CLEMENT ARNOLD, and had:
2 CONT 1. WILLIAM (5) ARNOLD
2 CONT 2. JOHN (5) ARNOLD
2 CONT 3. REBECCA (5) ARNOLD
2 CONT 4. PATSY (5) ARNOLD
2 CONT 5. NANCY (5) ARNOLD William (4) Kendrick Wood, b April 27, 1775, died April 3, 1834, md.   
2 CONT Rachel Robbins (children listed)
2 CONT Nancy  Wood, b Aug. 2, 1777, md. a Tucker and died without issue.
2 CONT Dorcas  Wood, b Dec. 16, 1778, md. (1) William Lee and.
2 CONT
2 CONT
