1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Penuel Wood, II''' was born on December 17, 1812, in Randolph County, North Carolina, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333232 Penuel Wood, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690553336 Sarah Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Penuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430360 Callista Wood] on May 2, 1832, in Randolph, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126342455 Rev Franklin Harris Wood]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430361 Eunice Roxanna Pearce]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430364 James Henry Bascom Wood]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430365 James W. Wood]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430363 Sarah Frances Person]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765430359 Sgt William Penuel Wood]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34765429966 Major Thomas Jones Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 8, 1881, in Randolph County, North Carolina, USA, and was buried in Asheboro City Cemetery, Asheboro, Randolph County, North Carolina, USA. 
2 CONT ----
