2 CONT == Biography ==Priscilla (Wood) Welborn was born on 3 Oct 1803 in Randolph County, North Carolina, United States, daughter of [[Wood-1672|Penuel Wood I]] (1772 - 1841) and [[Kimball-3069|Sarah (Kimball) Wood]] (1775 - 1814).
2 CONT
2 CONT Her siblings were:
