2 CONC  probed in the February 1831 Term of the Court of Randolph, North Carolina. The original will was dated 12 Feb 1830 a Codicil added 2 Oct 1830. [7] Below is a listing of the family. His spouse was named first then the sons were na
2 CONC med after which the unmarried daughters then the married daughters. Executors: Priscilla Welborn, spouse &amp; William Welborn, son 
