2 CONT '''Nancy Rachel Keerans''' was born on September 25, 1800 in United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-126333232 Penuel Wood, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690553336 Sarah Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy married [https://www.geni.com/profile-115725489 Allen Keerans] on January 31, 1821 in Randolph, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725077221 Pvt. Alson Jones Keearns, CSA];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663616854 Priscilla Londa Arnold];
