2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725077218 Henry Clay Kearns, Sr];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34845895396 Rev Isaac Franklin Keerans]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 6, 1878 in North Carolina, United States and was buried in Mount Shepherd United Methodist Church Cemetery, Asheboro, Randolph County, North Carolina, United States. 
