1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richard Andrews''' was born in 1780 in Mecklenburg, Virginia, United States, Mecklenburg County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725122773 Rowland Andrews, I] and [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC profile-34725122835 Henrietta Andrews]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764325643 Martha Harris]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before August 1850 in Randolph, North Carolina, United States, Randolph County, North Carolina, United States and was buried in 1850 in New Hope Methodist Church, Randolph County, North Carolina, USA, 7163 New Hope Road, N
2 CONC ew Hope, Randolph County, North Carolina, 27239, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT He before August 1850 in Randolph County, North Carolina, United States and was buried in New Hope United Methodist Church Cemetery[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/62651383]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * Reference:  Richard Wood's Wife's Will Name Martha Andrews (Wood) she was the daughter of Newsome Wood and Mary Polly Wood Neal, not Isham Harris. Newsome was the son of Isham Harris.  
2 CONT
