1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Laura Ann Wood''' was born on May 3, 1834 in North Carolina. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739557877 James Ledbetter] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739497267 Jane Ledbetter]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Laura married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558983 James Madison Wood] on February 12, 1852 in Guilford, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558987 Melissa Malissa Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558989 Jesse H. Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-117651035 John R. Wood, III];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558988 Ada Lenora Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558985 Wyatt Washington Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34739558984 James Oliver Wood];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34823124369 Martha Wood]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She died on March 11, 1889, and was buried in Hickory Grove United Methodist Church Cemetery, Guilford County, North Carolina, USA. * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/138705485/laura-ann-wood Find A Grave Memorial] 
