1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Walter Raleigh Hyman''' was born on January 6, 1861, in Palmyra, Halifax, North Carolina, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742481973 Aquilla Pierce Hyman] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742481975 Marth
2 CONC a Elizabeth Harrell]. He was a Wholesale Grocery Merchant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807674 Corinne Pearl Hyman] on November 27, 1897, in Luling, Caldwell, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137120 Aline Nelia Hyman];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742486071 Alta Estelle Hymon];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137122 Walter Walker Hyman];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137123 Benjamin Robert Hyman];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137124 Vance Andrews Hyman];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137119 Harrell Nixon Hyman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on December 28, 1943, in Luling Town, Caldwell, Texas and was buried Old Nixon Cemetery [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/24139876/walter-r-hyman]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
