1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Aline Nelia Hyman''' was born on August 17, 1902, in Luling, Caldwell Co., Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137118 Walter Raleigh Hyman] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807674 Corinne Pearl
2 CONC  Hyman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aline married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742486320 Willard Alvester Leavens] on February 12, 1928, in Laredo, Webb, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742486324 Willard Harre
2 CONC ll Leavens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 25, 1993, in Houston, Harris, Texas, USA, Luling, Caldwell County, TX, United States, and was buried in Webster, Harris County, Texas, United States of America.  [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/168566440/ali
2 CONC ne-nelia-leavens Find A Grave Memorial] 
