1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Alta Estelle Hymon''' was born on April 29, 1905, in Luling, Caldwell Co., Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137118 Walter Raleigh Hyman] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807674 Corinne Pearl
2 CONC  Hyman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alta married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758396062 Benjamin Mastin Fletcher] in 1944. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758396066 Frances Virginia Fletcher];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758396064 Pattie Hyman Fletcher];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758396067 Alta Nixon Fletcher];
