1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Vance Andrews Hyman''' was born on January 15, 1912, in Luling, Caldwell Co., Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741137118 Walter Raleigh Hyman] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740807674 Corinne Pe
2 CONC arl Hyman].  Hyman Oil Well Supply Co., Owner. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Vance married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742509492 Kathryn Schuetz Schuetz] circa 1935 in Texas. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742516660 Blanche Kay Hyman]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742509502 Vance Nixon Hyman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Vance married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742509493 Elizabeth West Dunning]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742516659 William Vance Hyman];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742516662 Robert Burgess Hyman]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 28, 1958, in Bexar, Texas, United States, Bexar County, TX, United States from Bullet Wound left lung and was buried in Alice, Texas, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082553272&view=1up&seq=11 "Early Nixon's of Texas" ]  by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956
