2 CONT
2 CONT Gonzales Inquirer May 1, 1958
2 CONT
2 CONT Vance N. Hyman is Found Dead
2 CONT
2 CONT Vance N. Hyman wealthy San Antonio oil well supply company owner, was found dead shortly after supper Monday evening on the second floor of his home.
2 CONT According to G. E. Hancock, chief deputy marshal of Olmos Park, he was shot through the chest with a high powered rifle. He was pronounced dead on arrival at the Baptist Memorial hospital.
2 CONT Survivors include his wife, the former Elizabeth Dunning of this city, and two sons, Robbie 8, and Billy 12.
2 CONT Contributor: Cindy S Munson (47210136) • pilot392jm2672@outlook.com
