1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Olive Gray Nixon (Read)''' was born on August 2, 1886, in Texas, Mineola. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687119553 Ben Franklin Read] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687119554 Cornelia Belle Tucker].  Coll
2 CONC ege degree at the University of Texas, Austin. Olive met Pat Ireland Nixon while they were both attending college. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He graduated in 1905, but they waited until he finished his medical degree at John Hopkins School of Medicine and establishing his practice in San Antonio before marrying on July 3, 1912, in Mineola, Texas. Olive married [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/profile-34687119548 Patrick Ireland Nixon, I, MD] on July 3, 1912, in Mineola, Wood County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239776 Patrick Ireland Nixon, II MD]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239774 Robert Read Nixon, MD]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239772 Benjamin Oliver Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741239775 Thomas Andrews Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on October 28, 1964, in Texas, Bexar, San Antonio and was buried after October 28, 1964, in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, United States of America. 
