1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Robert Read Nixon, MD''' was born on June 26, 1914, in Texas, Bexar Co, San Antonio. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687119548 Patrick Ireland Nixon, I, MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687119550 Olive G
2 CONC ray Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764633346 Wilma Countess Tabor] on December 31, 1940, in Little Rock, Arkansas, USA. They had two sons and a daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764632005 Carol Helen Learman] on February 11, 1967, in Guadalupe, Texas, USA. No children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on July 27, 1971, in San Antonio, Bexar, Texas, USA, and was buried after in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After Robert Read graduated from the University of Texas at Austin and Duke University Medical School.  he joined the Army and was stationed at West Point during WWII. In 1946 he returned to practice medicine with father and broth
2 CONC er in San Antonio.
2 CONT ----
