2 CONT
2 CONT **Her son made a mistake on her death certificate, listed her father as John Nixon- mother as unknown. had birthdate and place correct, She did have a brother named John Thomas Nixon, who died in Gonzales County, Texas which may h
2 CONC ave confused who son.  Texas Death Certificate Transcription
2 CONT
