2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Millicent Nixon''' was born on February 12,, 1769 in Center, Guilford, North Carolina, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-79313237 Jesse Henley] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-79313284 Anne Pretlow
2 CONC  (Henley)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Millicent intent to be married approved married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Phinehas Nixon, Sr., MD] on September 16, 1787 and then they were married October 16, 1787 in Back Creek Society Meeting of Friends, Randolp
2 CONC h, North Carolina, United States, Guilford, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742212590 Jesse H Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564134 Mary Cosand]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564153 Thomas Nixon, MD]; 
