2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742212592 Phineas Nixon, Jr.]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564215 Zachariah Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683063429 Barnabas Nixon, MD]; 
