2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564272 Stephen Nixon, MD]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564303 John Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564332 Henley Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-79564343 Millicent Jones]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 27, 1851 in Back Creek, Randolph, North Carolina, United States. 
