1 CHAN
2 DATE 03 SEP 2022
3 TIME 12:00:38
0 @I6000000106217576020@ INDI
1 NAME Jesse Henley /Nixon/
2 GIVN Jesse Henley
2 SURN Nixon
2 _MARNM Nixon
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 OCT 1788
2 ADDR
3 CITY Center
3 STAE North Carolina
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 15 MAR 1845
2 ADDR
3 STAE South Carolina
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Documented lineage- don't add children or a spouse.'''
2 CONT ----
2 CONT He didn't stay in The Society of Friends - Quakers- he was reprimanded for drinking and fighting. he eventually left, He married outside of religion without approval. he then joined the Methodist Church. 
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Jesse Henley Nixon''' was born on October 14, 1788, in Center, Guilford, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Phinehas Nixon, MD Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-7956390
2 CONC 6 Millicent Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742634610 Mary Ann Cox] on April 20, 1819. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742634612 Phineas Henley Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742634613 Sarah Millicent H. Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742634617 Martha Jane Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742634615 William Paul Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 15, 1845, in Horry, South Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Married out of Meeting- we have children listed in the genealogy book, Mary Ann Cox,  the marriage date April 20, 1819- Found marriage Record. He was a Farmer. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Not Quaker- left Religion
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT References:
2 CONT
2 CONT * _"Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956 [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082553272&view=1up&seq=11]__
2 CONT
2 CONT * Per review of several years, Census Reports the children of Jesse Nixon and Mary "Ann" Nixon were as listed in the Nixon genealogy book.
2 CONT * Caution: The online Ancestry.com MyHeritage and many online trees have errors that have been downloaded  - people don't realize it's wrong--- The children are not listed on the Census Report that has been added as Jesse and Mary
2 CONC  "Ann" Nixon (Cox) 's Children. They mixed and added children in that don't belong-
2 CONT
2 CONT * Easy to figure out when you take Census Reports year by year and compare them. Census Reports matched Nixon genealogy book.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * Also, along the way someone may have confused William Paul Nixon to William Pool Nixon, Pvt need to research, I saw William Pool Nixon with different Parents, so I'm keeping William Paul Nixon as The Nixon Genealogy Book has him
2 CONC  named for now. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
