1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary Cosand''' was born on May 27, 1790, in Center, Guilford, North Carolina, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Phineas Nixon, Il MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-79563906 Millicent 
2 CONC Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217332 Joseph Cosand] on June 28, 1815, in Randolph, North Carolina, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217333 Edwin Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217335 Mary Angelina Cosand]; Not Mary Ratliff Cosand
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217337 Sarah Millicent Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217336 Aaron Clayton Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217334 Phineas Nixon Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217338 Mary Ratliff Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217341 Stephen Grellet Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217340 Anna Mariah Cosand];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742217339 Thomas B. Cosand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 6, 1868, in Ackworth, Warren, Iowa, USA, and was buried after May 6, 1868, in Warren County, Iowa, United States of America. [https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?indiv=1&dbid=60525&h=89084157&ssrc=pt&tid=11
2 CONC 1701831&pid=430092072854&usePUB=true]
2 CONT ----
