1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Proven lineage please don't merge, add children or spouses. 
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Thomas Nixon, MD''' was born on April 22, 1792, in Back Creek, Randolph, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Phinehas Nixon, Sr., MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-79563
2 CONC 906 Millicent Nixon].  He was a physician and surgeon and was a member of The Friends Society, Quaker Religion. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742268938 Lydia Branson] on March 31, 1816, in Back Creek, Randolph, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742268940 William Edward Jenner Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742268941 James Nixon]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742268942 Millicent Jane Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 22, 1825, in Randolph County, North Carolina, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
