2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anna Henley Winslow''' was born on February 5, 1794, in Randolph, North Carolina, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Phinehas Nixon, Sr., MD] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-79563906 Mil
2 CONC licent Nixon]. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Anna married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742211121 Thomas Winslow] on April 5, 1820, in Friends Meeting, Back Creek, Randolph, NC, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742622642 Millicent N Winslow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742622643 Milton Winslow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742622645 Emily Ann Winslow]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742622644 Lydia Winslow]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 28, 1828, in Randolph, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Reference: 
2 CONT * "* Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956 [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082553272&view=1up&seq=11]
2 CONT * * [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/111701831/person/430092072844 Ancestry Genealogy
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000107241503824&][Clipping found in Carolina Watchman in Salisbury, North Carolina on May 6, 1852. Millicent Henley Nixon Will: May 2, 1852, Millicent Henley Nixon State of North C
2 CONC arolina, Randolph County Notice of Last Will and Testament, Henley Nixon appointed Executor, has left the State or gone to parts unknown: asking him to come forward ]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nancy  Anna Winslow  (Nixon)''' was born on February 5, 1794. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34651645294 Thomas W Winslow]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34651645070 Milton Nelson Winslow]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1830. 
2 CONT ----
