1 OCCU Physcian and Surgeon
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Barnabas Nixon, MD''' was born on December 20, 1799, in Randolph County, North Carolina. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683064081 Dr. Phineas Nixon, II] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-79563906 Millicent Nix
2 CONC on]. He was a Physician and Surgeon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barnabas married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683063438 Flora Marzillia Gardner]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909496 Mary Ada Moody (Nixon)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909501 William Penn Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683063424 Ella Mariah Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909495 Millicent Adelaide Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909500 George Fox Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909498 Orianna &quot;Ora&quot; Arnold (Nixon)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909497 Laura Emma Nixon];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741909499 Delphina Matilda Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1858 in Randolph, North Carolina, United States, Randolph County, NC, United States, and was buried in Back Creek Friends Meeting Cemetery, Randolph County, NC, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Find-a-Grave-  	 Back Creek Friends Meeting Cemetery - an actual gravesite of the Friends - many of our Nixon ancestor's have gravestones. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/51919433/barney-b_-nixon]
2 CONT
2 CONT Notice of marriage- we have the Quakers Meeting notes, but now we have a Newspaper notice.
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.newspapers.com/clip/35732740/the_weekly_standard/?xid=637&_ga=2.91695002.1280645816.1567831190-253262163.1567831190]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a medical doctor, first lived in Perquimans Count, later moved to Randolph County. Society of Friends/Quaker Religion.  Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  Mary Ada Nixon born Aug 6, 1839
2 CONT
2 CONT Milicent Adalaide Nixon, born Dec. 16, 1841
2 CONT
2 CONT Delphinia Matilda Nixon, born Feb 14, 1845
2 CONT
2 CONT Laura Emma Nixon, born Feb 19, 1848
2 CONT
2 CONT Orianna Wilson Nixon, born Feb. 28, 1852
2 CONT
2 CONT George Fox Nixon
2 CONT
2 CONT William Penn Nixon; disowned by Society of Friends, June 3, 1875.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ella Mae Nixon
2 CONT
