1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A113146  DAR Ancestor #: A113146]  Red Flagged:  "Future applicants must prove service."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT ''' Robert Thomas, I''' was born on April 16, 1767, in North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744649065 Theophilus Thomas Major, Esquire] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34744649066 Mary 
2 CONC Gibbs Rogers]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717926074 Margaret Thomas (Warrick)] on December 26, 1787, in Caswell County, NC, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088434 David Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088431 Mary Lambeth];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088433 Robert Thomas, Jr];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721081325 John Warwick Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088432 Margaret C Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717925391 Sarah Elizabeth Nixon (Thomas)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663616683 Jane Thomas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in March 1810 and is buried in Caswell County, NC, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''*
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Jewel Sink of Thomasville, NC kindly furnished much of the information for the Thomas lineage. 
2 CONT
