1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Margaret Thomas Merrill''' was born on November 9, 1771, in, Caswell County, North Carolina, United States. .  
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717926073 Robert Thomas, V] in 1797 in Caswell County, NC, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088434 David Thomas, Esq.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088433 Robert Thomas, II]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088431 Mary Loftin Lambeth]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721081325 John Warwick Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088432 Margaret C Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717925391 Sarah Elizabeth Nixon (Thomas)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663616683 Jane Lambeth]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-41235107 Daniel Merrell] on January 5, 1818, in Guilford County, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 23, 1837, in Thomasville, Davidson, North Carolina, USA,, in Thomasville, Davidson County, 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT "Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956 and other genealogists over the years''' made mistakes'''. Missed important docu
2 CONC ments the Marriage Bond of Margaret Warick and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717926073 Robert Thomas, V signed and placed by her father, John Warrick. dated and signed 26 Dec 1787. Andrew's name was picked up on a document and a
2 CONC ll assumed he was her father. Andrew had a daughter named Margaret Warrick, 1810-1866 married Select a profile image for Samuel Gillispie Sutton 1813-1896. Andrew Warrick mentioned his daughter Margaret in his probated will, but i
2 CONC t was not his sister. Well-documented family when the correct ones are followed. https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000178673612856[]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''*
2 CONT * Marriage Bond [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000178673612856] Father John Warrick signed 
