1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT David Thomas' was a Mason, a member of The North Carolina State Legislature in the 1830s, and was a member of the North Carolina House of Commons in 1832 -1833.  The Greensborough Patriot for June 16, 1840, had the following death
2 CONC  notice for David Thomas, Died - In this county of Wednesday last, the 10. The deceased has for years been a prominent and useful member of our community. He has several times represented the county in the General Assembly of the 
2 CONC State, and at home discharged the duties of Justice of the Peace. His death is sincerely mourned by his neighbors and regretted by all his fellow citizens of the county.” Earliest Settlers of Friedens Lutheran Church. “ 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''David Thomas''' was born on August 1, 1792, in Caswell County, North Carolina, Guilford County, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717926073 Robert Thomas] and [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC profile-34717926074 Margaret Thomas Merrill]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT David married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766690569 Elizabeth Whitesell] circa 1810 in NC. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789332 Robert Whitesell Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789333 John C. Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789335 Matilda Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789334 Lewis Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789336 Andrew Warrick Thomas]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789337 Daniel Merrell Thomas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT David married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721090495 Margaret Peggy Burney] on February 4, 1823, in Guilford County, NC, Guilford County, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766690577 Mary Wood Polly Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721090500 William Mebane Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789341 David Burney Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766690576 Sallie Jane Mae Thomas];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766789340 Mary Jane Thomas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 10, 1840, in Gibsonville, Alamance, North Carolina, USA, Guilford County, North Carolina, United States, and was buried in Friedens Lutheran Church Cemetery, Gibsonville, Guilford County, North Carolina, USA, Guilf
2 CONC ord County, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
