1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT His father left a legacy of vast land he inherited that became Thomasville, NC. proven by land deeds, Wills. John Warwick Thomas, the founder of Thomasville, NC Senator, politician, and educator, was born in Caswell County, the so
2 CONC n of Robert and Margaret Warwick Thomas. See Sources for more information.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Warwick Thomas''' was born on June 27, 1800, in Caswell County, North Carolina, USA, Caswell County, North Carolina, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717926073 Robert Thomas] and [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-34717926074 Margaret Thomas Merrill (Warwick)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088430 Mary Thomas] on January 26, 1818, in Davidson, North Carolina, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696582 William Dodson Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696587 Unnamed Son Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696584 Robert Warwick Thomas, MD]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696586 Elizabeth Addler Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088438 David Hill Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088439 John Warwick Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088441 Mary Jane Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088437 Henry Clay Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34721088440 Pleasant Campbell Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696585 Sarah Eliza Thomas]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766696583 Lewis Livingood Thomas]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 17, 1871, in Thomasville, Davidson, North Carolina, United States, Thomasville, Davidson County, North Carolina, United States and was buried in Thomasville, Davidson County, North Carolina, United States of America
2 CONC , Thomasville, Davidson County, North Carolina, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
