2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-405233441-1-500723/john-warwick-thomas-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-3c98759ca2dbf4207ff6bb701c5d5fbc&auth=5ccc73d0e5b563431560b27e2d080089&callback
2 CONC _token=hRU3joZaAbfsmMj4NaQ2U5o7Zm8816kBeQFBajQ6&mrid=2419f6db0ea163d5a3d43400368c539b MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 18 2018, 11:46:01 UTC''
