1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sarah Ella Bruton''' was born on October 2, 1859, in Raleigh, North Carolina, Wentworth, Rockingham, NC, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928431 Reverend David Rasberry Bruton] and [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-34717928405 Margaret Gaziell Bruton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743112851 Rufus Wilson Rev]. on Feb 14, 1884, in Greensboro, North Carolina, US. Rev. Wilson was a friend of Ella's father, he arranged her marriage to him. After his death, she decide
2 CONC d to travel and paint landscapes, her travels took her to the beautiful small islands pf Utila, Bay Islands, Honduras, where she met a handsome man, named Santiago,
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743112850 Santiago Pereira]. in 1886 in Utila, Islas de la Bahia, Honduras  Together they had the following children: 
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743112853 Guadalupe Pereira]; 
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34743112854 Albert Luis Pereira]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 06, 1906 Utila, Islas de la Bahia, Honduras died at sea and was buried at sea. 
2 CONT Her children were raised by her husband's family after her death. 
