1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Frances Idella Nixon''' was born on May 29, 1863 in Gonzales Co., TX, Seguin, Guadalupe County, TX, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717928407 Stephen Decatur Nixon] and [https://www.geni.com/prof
2 CONC ile-34717928503 Susan Caroline Nixon (Hisaw)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107569 James Mason Lynch] on July 5, 1883 in San Marcos, Hays, Texas, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107572 James Clyde Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107571 George Nixon Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107570 Nicholas Nolan Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107574 Ethel Lucile Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107573 Robert Clay Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107575 Mary Florine Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107576 Maude Catherine Sammie Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107579 Infant Boy Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107578 William Forbes Lynch];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34758107577 Carrie Louise Lynch Aka Johnnie]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 26, 1956 in Temple, Bell County, Texas, United States of America and was buried in Pendleton, Bell County, Texas, United States of America. 
