2 CONC home.com/tribute/details/841/Patty-Taliaferro/obituary.html] Original birth certificate list birth name as Patsy Nixon in 1928,  a corrected birth certificate list name as  Martha Baker Nixon in 1945 by her father.   She was the t
2 CONC win sister of  Mary King (Polly) Nixon. Correction courtesy contributor: Sue Lilley - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 14 2020, 21:25:30 UTC''
2 CONT
