2 CONT '''John Ernest McAnelly, Sr''' was born on March 30, 1918, in Medina County, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690044282 Gladden Clyde McAnelly, Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690044342 Hallie L
2 CONC aura Nixon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34778392767 Virginia Elizabeth Underwood] on July 27, 1943, in Nueces, TX. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34778392770 John Ernest McAnelly, Jr].
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 15, 1999, in Hondo, Medina County, Texas, USA and was buried in Hondo Cemetery, Hondo, Medina County, Texas, USA. 
