1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dora Mae Faseler (McAnelly)''' was born on April 29, 1914, in Yancey, Medina, Texas, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690044282 Gladden Clyde McAnelly, Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34690044342 Hall
2 CONC ie Laura McAnelly]. She was a Hondo High School Teacher, Home Economics. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dora married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759797 Robert Alton Faseler] on July 26, 1938, in Yancey, Medina, TX. Together they had five children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759809 Herbert Louis Faseler]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759808 Roberta Ann Faseler]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759805 Claudia June Faseler]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759807 Clyde Alton Faseler]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750759806 Lorine Marie Faseler]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 4, 2002, in Hondo, Medina, Texas, USA and was buried Yancey Cemetery, Yancey, Medina County, TX.[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19923390/dora-mae-faseler]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Education'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Texas State College for Women B.S, - Texas Women's University M.S.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas_Woman%27s_University]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Reference:''' 
2 CONT * [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/19923390/dora-mae-faseler]
2 CONT *"Early Nixon's of Texas" by Pat Ireland Nixon, MD, Genealogies by Dr. and Mrs. Pat Ireland Nixon, Jr., Published by Carl Hertzog, El Paso, Texas 1956 Hathitrust Early Nixon's of Texas actually has the details about Old Billy and 
2 CONC Frances Amanda Nixon filing suit for the bill against the US Government for the Horses not paid to Captain Robert Thomas Nixon Estate, it must've been a joint effort, evidently the some of the horses were also McAnelly horses not 
2 CONC paid for in the lot to the government. [https://devinenews.com/the-mcanelly-family/] [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas_Woman%27s_University]
