1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Wilson O McColpin''' was born circa 1891 in Tascosa, Oldham, Texas, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-43108853 John Henry McColpin] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-43109270 Cynthia Ann McColpin (Wood)]. Earl
2 CONC y in life he was a rancher, when he was living in California he was a machinist. Early Nixon's of Texas, genealogy book and census records confirm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013336 Bertha Bell McColpin (Nixon)] on December 19, 1918. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013389 Stephen Henry McColpin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761013390 Joseph Douglas McColpin, USAF];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761017252 James Gordan McColpin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761017251 Laura Belle McColpin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761017253 Boy Stillborn McColpin]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 21, 1978, in Lompoc, Santa Barbara, California and was buried after May 21, 1978, in Oakwood Memorial Park, Chatsworth, Los Angeles County, California, USA. Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/113431114 
2 CONC Find A Grave Memorial] His sister Grace is buried beside him,
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
