2 CONT '''Winona Byington Champion (Shanks)''' was born on May 12, 1893, in Windo, Ontario, Canada. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749487570 George Shanks] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749487572 Emma McRoy Miro].
2 CONC  She was legally adopted by her stepfather Dr. George Shanks when he married her mother, no record of her natural father. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Winona married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748670125 Albert Nicholas Champion Md, II] on April 5, 1919, in Manhattan, New York, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749483872 Jean Marg
2 CONC uerite Chandler (Champion)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in May 1983 in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas and was buried after May 1983 in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas, United States of America. 
