1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Florence Regina Tribolet''' was born on June 13, 1920, in Washington, District of Columbia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749396270 William H Tribolet, Sr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749396265 F
2 CONC lorence Mary Hadley]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Florence married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748670128 John Nixon Champion, Sr]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749395935 Judith Ann Champion]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34749395937 John Nixon Champion, Jr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 6, 2001, in Louisville, Jefferson, Kentucky She was cremated.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She, her husband and children lived in Damascus, Syria from 1946 until August 1948. The Nixon genealogy book also stated they lived in Saudi Arabia, also found travel documentation for travel to Scotland. 
2 CONT
