2 CONC e, Baltimore, Maryland; FHL microfilm 13,696. ↑ St Paul Protestant Episcopal Church, Baltimore, Baltimore, Maryland. ↑ 1790 U. S. Federal Census, Mine Run Hundred, Baltimore County, Maryland [online at Ancestry.com where Mine is m
2 CONC is-transcribed as Misc.] ↑ Maryland Hall of Records, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore Co. Court Minutes, page 305, "An Alphabetical List of Persons Not taken the Oath of Allegiance .... Mino (sic) [Mine] Run, Green Isaac, Green, Meshack, 
2 CONC Green Shadrack, Green Abednago" http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=greenrl&id=I1435 ↑ Baltimore County Wills: (WK72,242 Bk6, f277) <http://www.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~mdbaltim/wills/will243.htm> ↑ Hall of Rec
