2 CONT
2 CONT Please be careful looking at online ancestry trees, this lineage was merged by mistake on the Family Tree and Ancestry.com - Wiki may have the same problems copied as well. Must follow probated Wills, Marriage docs, etc. 
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Edward Stevens''' was born in 1747 in Baltimore, Maryland, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761564175 George Giles Stevens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761564171 Alice Elsie Gudgeon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532594 Jemina Green] on November 5, 1795 in Liberty, Georgia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532596 Elijah G Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532597 Rutha Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532598 John W Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532600 Silas Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532601 Stephen B Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532604 Lucy Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532436 William J Stevens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1823 in Wilkes County, Georgia, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Haven't found the original marriage Bond for Edward and Elizabeth Stevens (Green), found an online filled in only Family Tree - It can't be correct for Nov 1795, it would have to be 1796. his wife 1 was still alive, her Will 
2 CONC probated last day of December 1795 in Sampson, NC where she passed away, so Edwards two children born 1st part of Dec are her's she died complications of childbirth of twins. 
2 CONT
