2 CONT '''Elijah G Stevens''' was born on May 22, 1772, in Baltimore County, Maryland, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532599 Edward Stevens] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761532594 Jemima Stevens (Green)].
