2 CONT
2 CONT Elijah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762225837 Faitha Rogers] circa 1793 in Milledgeville, Baldwin, Georgia, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762225839 Simeon Lucas Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762225840 West W. Stevens];
