2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762225844 Hilliard J. Stevens];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34762225845 Cynthia C. Stevens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 12, 1860, in Rutland, Bibb, Georgia, USA. 
