1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Eli Columbus Kilby''' was born on May 10, 1862, in Wilkes Co, NC. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-36842439 John Wesley Kilby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-36847272 Delilah Bumgarner]. He was a Farmer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eli married [https://www.geni.com/profile-36855912 Fanny M Rash] in 1885 in NC, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652770045 James Wilborn Kilby];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-36841993 William &quot;Bud&quot; Filmore Kilby];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-36845966 Mary Lou Kilby];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-36852861 Wellborn Wilborn Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 1, 1944, in Wilkes, NC, USA and was buried in Pleasant Home Ch. Cemetery. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * '''Race''': White
