2 CONT '''Married her 1st cousin, same last name Kilby'''
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Jane Kilby''' was born on September 6, 1848 in Wilkes County, North Carolina, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-36842439 John Wesley Kilby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-36846579 Martha Wilcoxen]
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826640465 James Wesley Kilby] in 1865 in Wilkes County, NC, United States. Together they had the following children: They divorced  after 1884
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826642039 James Columbus Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641421 Martha C Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641423 John Murphy Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641422 Mary Alvertia Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826642040 William Troy Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 6, 1924 in Wilbar, Wilkes, NC, USA and was buried on August 8, 1924 in Millers Creek, Wilkes County, North Carolina, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
