1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Married his 1st Cousin, same last name'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Wesley Kilby''' was born in 1848 in Atlanta, Atlanta, Fulton, Georgia, US. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34775674122 William J Kilby] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826640458 Jane Carruthers Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641420 Elizabeth Jane Kilby (Kilby)] in 1865 in Wilkes County, NC, United States. Together they had the following children: They divorced after 1884.
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826642039 James Columbus Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641421 Martha C Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641423 John Murphy Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826641422 Mary Alvertia Kilby];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34826642040 William Troy Kilby]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before 1930 in Wilkes County, North Carolina, US. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
