1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''David Homer Gilley''' was born on November 22, 1943 in Lawton, Comanche County, Oklahoma, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34849535855 William Wayne Gilley] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3484953
2 CONC 5854 Mary Lu Gilley]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT David married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34718114844 Dorothy Nixon Nixie Gilley] on June 25, 1966 in Lawton, Comanche County, Oklahoma, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 12, 1990 in Lawton, Comanche County, OK, United States and was buried in Sunset Memorial Gardens, Lawton,															Comanche County,															Oklahoma,																USA. 
