1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Edward Alan Moring''' was born on December 2, 1958, in Pecos, Texas. Edward's parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34764769761 Joseph Herndon Moring] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760681466 Barbara Jean Moring]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward died on February 10, 1962, in Dallas, Dallas County, Texas, the USA from Cerebral Hemorrhage and Pediatric  Acute Lymphatic Leukemia, only 10 days after diagnosis and was buried after in Eastlawn Memorial Park, Early, Brown
