1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''James C. Colvin''' was born on October 19, 1769, in Culpeper, Culpeper County, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-55676615 Daniel Colvin] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-55677970 Elizabeth Colvin]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James married [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964283 Mary Martha Hill (Colvin)] on November 13, 1806, in Culpeper, Culpeper County, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964351 Sarah Jane Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964367 Elizabeth Ann Cauthorn];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21089955293 William Daniel Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648916368 Frances Lilly Cauthorn];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-90491733 Martha James Lewis (Colvin)];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685672 John Randolph Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964324 James Armistead Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964468 Mary Russell Field (Colvin)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 19, 1841, in Culpeper, Culpeper, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Not a Patriot- too young.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.familysearch.org/library/books/records/?navigation=&perpage=&page=1&sort=_score&search=Lancaster+From+Virginia+to+Texas&fulltext=1&bookmarks=0 Lancasters From Virginia to Texas - Family Search Library]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Culpeper County Virginia Records, Will Book P, page 253, Division of Slaves of James Colvin, Deceased, among his children.  '''Will Probate 15 NOV 1841 • Culpeper, Virginia, USA - Death Oct 19, 1841.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '* ''James Colvin was not a Patriot''' but was a descendant of Daniel Colvin, Revolutionary Soldier( DAR National NO 443238) through Miss Russell Lucille Colvin. Etc. Patriot. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
