2 CONT '''Mary Martha Hill (Colvin)''' was born in 1782 in Culpeper County, Virginia, USA, Middlesex, Accomack County, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648920395 William Hill] and [https://www.gen
2 CONC i.com/profile-7327886 Mary Jane Hill (Wood)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-55670342 James C. Colvin] on November 13, 1806, in Culpeper, Culpeper County, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964351 Sarah Jane Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964367 Elizabeth Ann Cauthorn];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21089955293 William Daniel Colvin];
