2 CONT '''John Randolph Colvin''' was born on August 2, 1826, in Culpeper, Culpeper, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-55670342 James C. Colvin] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964283 Mary Marth
2 CONC a Hill (Colvin)]. He was a Deputy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685682 Letitia E Colvin] circa 1851. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685838 John Wharton Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695083860 Dr James Armistead Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34753194188 James Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34695083861 Mary Lizzie Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685880 Nannie Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685924 Rebeca Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34676657599 Russell Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685951 Sarah Colvin];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34650685376 Gabriel Randolph Colvin]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 26, 1908, in Culpeper, Culpeper County, Virginia, the United States in Masonic Cemetery, Culpeper, Culpeper County, Virginia, USA. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/15679568#]
