2 CONT '''Henry Field''' was born in 1768 in St Marks Parish, Culpepper, Virginia, USA, Culpeper, Virginia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34680983114 Capt. John Field, Jr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34670389069 D
2 CONC iana Field]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34692402028 Frances Field (Hill)] in 1796 in Culpeper, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742471713 John Field Captain];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742471714 Ann Powell Kelly];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742471718 Diana A Field];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34742471716 Elizabeth Jane Field];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-126964477 Henry Hill Field];
