1 OCCU Elementary School  Music Teacher
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Annie Russell Field''' was born on March 25, 1880, in Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278435 William Edward Field] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278620 Susan Victorine Field]. 
2 CONC Never married, she was an elementary music school teacher, she and her sisters were loved by her nieces and nephews. They share fond memories of family picnics at the Field Family home. She lived most of her life in the family hom
2 CONC e with the exception of the time she attended college. She taught public school until her retirement for Lockhart Public ISD, Lockhardt, Caldwell, Texas. Never Married.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 1, 1958, and is buried in The Field Family Section of Lockhart Municipal Cemetery in Lockhart, Caldwell County, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Education University of Texas, Elementry Education, Music.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
