2 CONT '''Willie Lynn Field''' was born on May 8, 1896, in Lockhart, Caldwell County, Texas, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278435 William Edward Field] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34678278620 Su
2 CONC san Victorine Field]. She was a School Teacher with Lockhardt, Texas ISD until her retirement. She and her sisters were fondly remembered as favorite aunts and teachers of many generations of children. The Field Family Home hosted
2 CONC  many family picnics on their lawn during the summer and spring. Never married.
2 CONT
