2 CONT Deaths Cause Anxiety. Austin, Tex., Feb. 14.—Texas State Representative Thomas McNeal of Lockhart died this morning ... of cerebral-spinal meningitis, lie was taken ill yesterday. The death of Representative McNeal follows close u
2 CONC pon that of Representative Killingsworth of Marshall, which occurred yesterday. The deaths from ... to a farmer named Holmes was killed yesterday afternoon while standing hitched to an electric light pole on David street. The pole
2 CONC  was also a transformer pole, the ground wire being protected by the regulation ... lifeless. 
