2 CONT Obituary Gonzales Inquirer Jan. 29, 1959
2 CONT
2 CONT Final Rites Held For F. H. McNeal
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services were held in Cuero Saturday at 2 p.m. for F. H. McNeal youngest brother of Mrs. A. H. Fitzgerald.
2 CONT Born in Gonzales county, Mr. McNeal was a professor of English in the University of Alabama, and had made his home prior to his death in Tuscaloosa, Ala.
2 CONT Going down to attend the services were Mr. and Mrs. J.E.Lawley, and Mr. and Mrs. J. R. Tinsley, Jr., and children, Carolyn and Jimmy.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/183717036/thomas-hill-mcneal Find A Grave Memor
