1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Amanda Harriett Trigg''' was born in 1818 in Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34820187924 Anthony Harvey] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34820187923 Mary Polly Bingham]. She was the cou
2 CONC sin of John Trigg's first wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Amanda married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715937635 John A Trigg] on December 27, 1852, in Marshall, Saline County, MO, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717967765 Dotia Cooney];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717967764 Abner J Trigg]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1890 in Saline County, Missouri, USA, and was buried in 1890 in Marshall, Saline County, Missouri, United States of America. 
