2 CONT '''Theodosia Cooney''' was born on April 21, 1856 in Cooper County, Missouri, United States of America, Saline County, Missouri, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715937635 John Anthony Trigg] and [ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/profile-34717967747 Amanda H. Trigg]. She was a Music Teacher, Pianist. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodosia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741429360 Judge James A. Cooney] on December 21, 1882 in Marshall, Saline, Missouri, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 8, 1941, in Marshall, Saline County, Missouri, United States of America, and was buried there. No Issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a Music and French Teacher and a Women's Activist. She never remarried, she was beautiful, perhaps an independent woman. [https://www.newspapers.com/clip/35418121/the_hutchinson_news/]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
