1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary Frances Trigg (Williams)''' was born on January 8, 1838, in Cooper County, Missouri, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741234393 Thomas L. Williams] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34741234394 Frances
2 CONC  Taylor Sutherlin]. She was a Homemaker. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34717967761 William H. Trigg] in 1862 in Cooper, Missouri, USA. They had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on May 30, 1912, in Denton, Texas, USA and was buried after May 30, 1912, in Denton, Denton County, Texas, United States of America. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Excerpt from father-in-law's will - Fifthly, I give to my daughter-in-law Mary Frances the wife of my son William the sum of $200, this sum is to be subject to her control and management.
