2 CONT '''Blanche Trigg''' was born on May 19, 1878, in Joplin, Jasper, Missouri, USA. She was a Librarian. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 15, 1950, from Hodgkin's Disease and was buried after September 15, 1950, in Fairview Cemetery, Joplin, Jasper County, Missouri, USA. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT She never married and lived at home, returning after completing her college degree. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Profession: Librarian 
