2 CONT '''Mary Ann Ambrister''' was born in 1796 in Sevier County, Tennessee, US. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-24098200 Johan Jurg &quot;George&quot; Derrick] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639952811 Hannah Byrd]. 
