2 CONT '''Phillip Henry Armbrister''' was born in 1796 in Wythe, Virginia, United States, Wythe County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34711741841 George W. Armbrister] and [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rofile-34639952760 Barbara Armbrister]. 
