1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nathaniel Lancaster, II of Rockmill''' was born on September 27, 1790, in Clover Forest, Cumberland Co, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-2751812 John Lancaster, IV Of Clover Forest Plantation] and [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-2751701 Margaretta Drusilla Lancaster (LeGrand)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756733364 Sarah Lancaster (Cook)] in 1818 in Buckingham Co, VA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101482 John Alexander Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756733365 Amanda B. Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756733368 Hester Ann Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756733369 William Legrand Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on May 19, 1841, in Rockmill, Buckingham, Virginia, United States, and was buried on his property Rockmill Estate in  Buckingham County, Virginia, United States of America. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/28053812/nat
2 CONC haniel-lancaster#source]
