2 CONT '''Judith Baker Gannaway (Lancaster)''' was born on March 30, 1794, in Clover Forest, Cumberland Co, Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-2751812 John Lancaster, IV Of Clover Forest Plantation] and [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/profile-2751701 Margaretta Drusilla Lancaster (LeGrand)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756734923 George W. Gills] on February 22, 1814, in Buckingham, Virginia, USA. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756734925 Emiline Gills]
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756734922 Theoderick Carter Gannaway]. Together they had the following children:
