2 CONT '''William LeGrand Lancaster''' was born on December 28, 1796, in Clover Forest, Cumberland Co, Virginia, USA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-2751812 John Lancaster, IV Of Clover Forest Plantation] and [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-2751701 Margaretta Drusilla Lancaster (LeGrand)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756732067 Margaret Miller Wygal] on August 27, 1823, in Montgomery County, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756732068 Josiah Baker Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756732069 Ellen L. Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756732070 DeWitt C. Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756732071 Virginia Lancaster];
