1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Thompson Mason Rector II''' was born on October 10, 1838 in Bellefonte, Jackson County, Alabama, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794896 Thomas Mason Rector I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34
2 CONC 715964803 Lucy Ann Lancaster Rector]. He was a Judge, Planter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thompson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794823 Lavinia Ann Norwood] on January 3, 1866 in Texas. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794824 Ida Jeanette Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794825 Olive Lucy Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794826 Walter B. Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794827 Stilla Dona Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794828 Maude Catherine Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794829 Sallie Lavinia Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794830 James Mason Rector]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794831 Clyde Ann Rector]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 20, 1925 in Austin, Travis County, Texas, United States and was buried in Manor, Travis County, Texas, United States. 
