2 CONT '''Landoria Madaline Rector''' was born on September 7, 1846, in Bellefonte, Jackson County, Alabama, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-49794896 Thomas Mason Rector I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-
