2 CONT
2 CONT * Capt. John Hudson mentioned in his father’s Will. William Hudson. Attached in Media for viewing, the original can be found in Will Book 3, pg. 180, Prince Edward County Court Records
2 CONT *     Marriage Bond of John Hudson and Lucy Baker Hudson Married on June 3, 1790. She was about age 20 yrs old. We wondered if during that era she was considered a spinster or that was a term used for a woman over the age of 18yrs
2 CONC  old.   [edit]   
