1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT Military record, was a Major, and served in the Military.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Caleb Baker Hudson, Major''' was born on November 22, 1794, in Prince Edward County, VA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34688527390 Capt. John Hudson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715964891 Lucy Hudson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Caleb married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831845 Martha C. Hudson] on September 21, 1814 in Prince Edward County, Virginia, USA. Together, they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831847 Mary Ann Hudson];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831848 John W Hudson];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831850 Martha Eliza Hudson];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831849 Catherine Jane Hudson].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Caleb married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831846 Ann Maria Hudson] on March 24, 1823, in Halifax, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831853 Alfred Hudson Captain];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831852 Clement L Hudson];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34809831851 Martha Gilliam Hudson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on June 7, 1834 in Jackson County, Alabama, USA. Most likely buried in Bellefonte Cemetery, Belllefonte, Alabama, Cemetery is in bad condition, many graves have lost headstones and graves. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
