2 CONT '''York Lancaster, MD''' was born on November 9, 1916 in Bishop, Nueces, Texas, United States, Bishop, Nueces County, Texas, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716575060 William Moore Lancaster] and [h
2 CONC ttps://www.geni.com/profile-34725329133 Mini Lee Lancaster (York)]. He was a physician. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT York married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725329156 Mary Elizabeth Dardeau] on December 4, 1948 in Calhoun County, Texas, United States, Calhoun County, Texas, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748970247 Dorothy Lucille Lancaster];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748970249 Robert Dardeau Lancaster];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748970248 Thomas Moore Lancaster];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34748970250 Patris Ann Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT York partnered in 1947 with [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716574785 Nancy Jane Nichol]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34716571744 Rick Clausen Lancaster]. born, Oct 30, 1947 in  Galveston, Galveston County, Texas, US proven by yDNA FTDNA and autosomal with Lancaster lineage, as well as adoption birth records.
2 CONT
2 CONT York married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34725329157 Audrey Lancaster] on March 30, 1973 in Calhoun, Texas, USA, Calhoun County, Texas, United States. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 19, 1993 in Conroe, Montgomery County, Texas, United States, Conroe, Montgomery County, Texas, United States and was buried after April 19, 1993 in Conroe, Montgomery County, Texas, United States of America, Conro
2 CONC e, Montgomery County, Texas, United States. 
