2 CONT '''Ethel Little Lancaster Barnes Atty, CPA''' was born on December 4, 1903, in Reynolds, Jefferson, Nebraska, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34766048400 Clarence W Barnes] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-347
2 CONC 66048398 Anna C Little]. She was an Attorney, CPA, Business Owner. Title Business.
2 CONT
